2 CONC Nicol%20-%20The%20Last%20Centuries%20of%20Byzantium%2C%201261-1453%2C%202nd%20Edition/page/n5/mode/1up Archive.Org] >; < [https://books.google.com/books/about/The_Last_Centuries_of_Byzantium_1261_145.html?id=y2d6OHLqwEsC GoogleBoo
2 CONC ks search inside] >. Page 403-404. < [https://books.google.com/books?id=y2d6OHLqwEsC&lpg=PA403&vq=Koyunlu&pg=PA404#v=onepage&q=Koyunlu&f=true GoogleBooks] > Manuel III is mentioned but no daughters married into the Koyunlu.
