2 CONT
2 CONT  Two possible siblings, parents not known.  It is not known whether they were agnatic or cognatic descendants of the Palaiologos family. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.      '''   [--- Angelos''' .  Ioannes Kantakouzenos names "uno enim magistro avunculo nostro Angelo magno stratopedarcha", "nostro" apparently referring both to "magnus domesticus" who is the speaker in this section of the text
2 CONC  and is identified with the author, the future Emperor Ioannes VI Kantakouzenos, and to "Syrgiannes"[90].  The identity of this person has not been ascertained and the precise relationships are not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.''']'''  One possible child: 
