2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radoslav_Hlapen
2 CONT
2 CONT Radoslav Hlapen married Irina (Irene), the widow of caesar Preljub. They had the following issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Maria Angelina Radoslava, married Alexios Angelos Philanthropenos
