2 CONT # Rayfield, Donald (2012). Edge of Empires: A History of Georgia. London: Reaktion Books. p. 148. ISBN 1780230303.
2 CONT # Toumanoff, Cyril (1949–51). "The Fifteenth-Century Bagratids and the Institution of Collegial Sovereignty in Georgia". Traditio 7: 181–183.
