1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Pirbudag''' (1403/1404 – October 1418, reigned 1411 – October 1414) was the first ruler of Qara Qoyunlu as an independent sultanate. Pirbudag was the eldest son of Qara Yusuf, born around 1403 during his father's captivity.
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Ahmad Jalayir, Pirbudag was crowned sultan by his father Qara Yusuf in 1411 at the age of eight or nine.[3] He is recorded to have been the commander of raiding party in Aintab pursuing Qara Osman. He died unexp
2 CONC ectedly in October 1418.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Likely contemporary depiction of Pirbudag. The Monastery, 1407-08 (Topkapı Palace Museum, TSMK H.2153, f.131b)[1]
2 CONT
