2 CONC rd Dictionary of Byzantium (Oxford , 1991), 3 vols. K. Varzos, Ē genealogia tōn Komnēnōn (Thessalonica, 1984) Plate, William (1867). "Alexios III Angelos". in William Smith. Dictionary of Greek and Roman Biography and Mythology. 1
