2 CONT Isaac II Angelos or Angelus (Greek: Ισαάκιος Β’ Άνγελος, Isaakios II Angelos) (September 1156 – January 1204) was Byzantine emperor from 1185 to 1195, and again from 1203 to 1204.
2 CONT
