2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (before 1355) IVAN Asen Komnenos of Bulgaria, Serbian Governor of Valona, Kanina and Berat, son of STRACIMIR despot & his wife Kereza Petriza of Vidin (-before 13 May 1363).
