2 CONC os & his wife, stating that Anna married Vladislav son of Stefan duke of Bosnia[634].  m (Mar 1455) VLADISLAV of Saint Sava [Bosnia], son of STEFAN Vukčić Kosaca, Herceg of Saint Sava, [Vojvoda of Bosnia], & his first wife Jelena 
2 CONC Balša of Zeta ([1427]-[27 Oct 1487/1 Nov 1489]). 
