2 CONT The Spandounes family had not played any significant role in the history of the Byzantine Empire before this date, but more is known about Theodore’s mother, '''Eudotia Kantakouzene''', and her side of the family. '''Her grandfath
2 CONC er was George Palaiologos Kantakouzenos''', a great soldier and scholar, as well as a direct descendant of Emperor John VI Kantakouzenos (1347–1354).
2 CONT
