2 CONT This passage too is introduced out of chronological context and mainly to illustrate another piece of the Spandounes family history. The Turkish conquest of Bosnia began in 1463, The Duke (‘Herzog’) of St Saba at the time was Stje
2 CONC pan Vukcic (1435-00). His eldest son was '''Ladislas'''; and it was he who '''married Anna Cantacuzene'''  who, according to '''[Theodore] Spandounes, was-a sister of his grandfather (Theodore Cantacuzene)''' and a daughter of Geo
2 CONC rge Palaiologos Cantacuzene.
