2 CONT ii)         '''MARIA''' .  The Masarelli Vatican manuscript names (in order) Georgios, Maria, Eudokia and Alexandra as the children of Theodoros, son of Georgios, and his wife, stating that Maria married Ierachi[602].  m --- Ierac
2 CONC hi, son of ---. 
