2 NICK Murad II
1 NAME Murad II of the Ottoman Empire
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Bursa
3 CTRY Turkey
1 BIRT
2 DATE 16 JUN 1404
2 ADDR
3 CITY Amasya
3 STAE Amasya Province
3 CTRY Turkey
