2 CONT Bernabò Visconti He had 17 legitimate children with his wife (Beatrice Regina della Scala):
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.	Valentina Visconti (1360–1393), married firstly in 1378, King Peter II of Cyprus, by whom she had one daughter who died in early infancy; she married secondly, Galeazzo, Count of Virtù
