2 CONT
2 CONT a)         ZABEL (-3 Apr 1310).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  The Chronique du Royaume de la Petite Arménie of Constable Sempad records the death in [3 Jan 1310/1 Jan 1
2 CONC 311] of "la reine Isabelle…en donnant au roi Oschin un fils…Léon"[1040].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' as his first wife, OSHIN King of Armenia, son of LEWON II King of Armenia & his wife Kyr Anna [Theophano] of Lampron (1282-murdered 20 Jul 1320, bur Trazarg).  
