2 CONC egis sebasto domino Joanne Cantacuzeno...”[449].  The record of the synod of 6 Mar 1166 records the presence of “...pansebasto sebasto et genero...nostri regis domino Joanne Cantacuzeno...”[450].  m ([1145/50]) as her second husba
2 CONC nd, MARIA Komnene, widow of THEODOROS Dasiotes, daughter of ANDRONIKOS Komnenos, sébastokrator & his wife Eirene [Aineiadissa] ([1126]-).  Ioannes Kinnamos records that "Ioannes cognomento…Cantacuzenus" married "Andronici sebastoc
2 CONC ratoris filiam"[451].  Ioannes Kantakouzenos & his wife had [two] children:
