2 CONT # Cawley, Charles, Listing of Alexios I and his children, Foundation for Medieval Genealogy, retrieved August 2012,[better source needed]
2 CONT # Christopher Buyers,"Georgia:The Bagrationi (Bagration) Dynasty"
