2 CONC o Constantinople, the conspirators produced pamphlets that mocked and slandered the empress, and left them in her tent. A search for the author of the publications uncovered the whole plot, yet Aron was only banished due to his co
2 CONC nnection of the royal line of Bulgaria, whose blood also flowed in the veins of the empress Irene. 
