1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://el.wikipedia.org/wiki/%CE%99%CF%83%CE%B1%CE%AC%CE%BA%CE%B9%CE%BF%CF%82_%CE%9A%CE%BF%CE%BC%CE%BD%CE%B7%CE%BD%CF%8C%CF%82
