2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SERBIA.htm#StefanRadoslavdiedafter1235
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         STEFAN RADOSLAV ([1191/1201]-after 1235).  The life of St Sava by Domentijan names "Radoslav" as oldest son of "l’autocrate Etienne" when recording that he succeeded his father[147].  In [1216], his father appears to ha
2 CONC ve installed him in part of Hum, after intervening after the expulsion of Knez Andrej by his [supposed] brother Petar, and in Zeta[148].  “Stephanus Serbiæ rex et filius Radoslavus” founded “monasterio Žiča” by charter dated to [1
2 CONC 222/28][149].  He succeeded on the abdication of his father in [1224/27] as RADOSLAV "Krapalo" King of Serbia, crowned at Žiča by his uncle Archbishop Sava.  Unpopular due to the influence asserted by his wife, rebellion broke out
2 CONC  against him in Autumn 1233.  King Radoslav was forced to flee Serbia in [late 1233/early 1234], taking refuge in Dubrovnik from where he issued a charter giving himself the Byzantine name Dukas: “Stephanus Radoslav, Serbiæ rex” p
2 CONC romised privileges to the merchants of Ragusa by charter dated 4 Feb 1234 at Ragusa[150].  He eventually returned to Serbia and became a monk as JOVAN[151].  The life of St Sava by Domentijan records that "le roi Radoslav, pour ex
2 CONC pier quelques fautes, prit la tonsure monastique" and was succeeded by his brother[152].  [Betrothed (before 1217) to THEODORA Komnene, daughter of MIKHAEL Dukas Komnenos [Angelos] Lord of Epirus & his second wife Melissene ---.  
2 CONC Theodora's betrothal to "--- of Serbia, son of Stefan Grand Župan of Serbia" is recorded in Europäische Stammtafeln[153].  The primary source on which this is based has not yet been found, and the identity of her betrothed has not
2 CONC  been established, but he may have been Radoslav, the betrothal being agreed at the same time as that of his father to Theodora's sister.]  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' [firstly] ([29 Oct 1219/9 Feb 1220], [separated 1234]) ANNA Dukaina Angelina, daughter of THEODOROS Komnenos Dukas Angelos Lord of Epirus [later Emperor at Thessaloniki] & his wife Maria Dukaina Komnene Petraliphaina (-[12
2 CONC 58]).  Georgius Akropolites names "Ioannes et Demetrius…Anna et…Irene" as the children of "Angeli Theodori"[154].  Ephræmius names "Ioannes et Demetrius atque Anna, denique Irene uxor Asanis Bulgari" as the four children of "Theod
2 CONC ori…Comnenangeli"[155].  Her marriage was arranged by her father as part of peace terms with Serbia[156].  The life of St Sava by Domentijan records that "Radoslav son cousin" (referring to Saint Saba) married "l’empereur grec…Thé
2 CONC odore Lascaris…la fille"[157].  The primary source which confirms her correct parentage has not yet been identified.  Her influence over her husband triggered the 1233 rebellion which led to his deposition[158].  She became a nun.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[m''' secondly ---.  No proof has been found of this possible second marriage.  However, as discussed below, if Radoslav’s supposed son, Dragoslav Jovan, was still alive in 1315 he would probably have been in his eighties if bo
2 CONC rn from his father’s known marriage, which suggests the possibility of an otherwise unrecorded second marriage.  The titles attributed to Dragoslav Jovan and his descendants suggest that it is unlikely that he was illegitimate.'''
2 CONC ]''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Radoslav & his [first] wife had [one child]: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT Стефан Радослав е сръбски крал, управлявал Сърбия в периода 1228-1234 г.
2 CONT
2 CONT Стефан Радослав е първороден син на Стефан Първовенчани и византийската принцеса Евдокия. През 1228 наследява баща си на трона. Сключва брак с Анна Теодора Комнина, дъщеря на епирския деспот (1215-1230) Теодор Комнин и сестра на И
2 CONC рина Комнина, но няма наследници.
2 CONT
2 CONT Недалновиден владетел, Стефан Радослав разчита единствено на своя тъст. След като Теодор Комнин е разгромен военно от Иван Асен II, Стефан Радослав е детрониран от сръбската аристокрация и мястото му е заето от неговия по-малък бр
2 CONC ат Владислав.
2 CONT
2 CONT Стефан Радослав, както и наследилия го̀ на престола негов брат Стефан Владислав, чрез майка си Евдокия и посредством Ирина Дукина и династията на Комнините се падат осма степен преки потомци на българския цар Иван Владислав и на к
2 CONC омитопулите. Стефан Радослав и брат му Владислав са далечни потомци на комитопулите ѝ по бащина линия чрез Константин Бодин, т.к. Завида е свързан родствено с управляващата Зета династия.
2 CONT
2 CONT Стефан Радослав се замонашва и умира в манастира Студеница.
