2 CONT *'''King of Germany(formally King of the Romans):''' Reign: 1198–1208 (contested by Otto IV)	
2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-VI-Holy-Roman-Emperor/6000000003614102983 Henry VI] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Otto-IV-Holy-Roman-Emperor/6000000000107264196 Otto IV]
