2 CONT
2 CONT         Fedora Romanovna (?–after 1200), wife of Vasilko Vladimirovich of Halych;[1]
2 CONT         Elena Romanovna[2] (or Maria Romanovna) (?–after 1241), wife of Prince Mikhail Vsevolodovich of Chernigov[1]
2 CONT         (?) Salomea Romanovna (?–before 1220), wife of Duke Swantopolk I of Pommerellen,[1] her mother is uncertain;[9]
