2 CONT C3. Danylo, Pr of Galicia (1211-13)+(1229-64), Pr of Volynia (1215-64), crowned by a papal archbishop in Dorohychyn 1253/55 as 1st King of Galicia, *1201, +1264; 1m: 1218 Anna Mstislavna of Novgorod (+bef 1252); 2m: bef 1252 N, ni
