2 CONC ship. According to the Ukrainian historian Orest Subtelny, Daniel was handed a cup of fermented mare's milk by the Mongol khan Batu and told to get used to it, as "you are one of ours now." They exchanged hostages whereby 100 Kera
2 CONC it Tatar families were re-settled in Carpathian Galicia.
