2 CONT The family was founded by Guillaume I, chatelain de Saint-Omer 1100/28; m.Aganitrude, a woman from Bruges; They had issue:
2 CONT *A1. Guillaume II, chatelain de Saint-Omer, fl 1126-43; m.Melisende de Picquigny
2 CONT **B1. Guillaume III, chatelain de Saint-Omer, fl 1132-70; m.Matilda N
2 CONT ***C1. Guillaume IV, chatelain de Saint-Omer, sn de Fauquemberghes, +in the Holy Land 1191/92; 1m: before 1171 Ida d'Avesnes; 2m: Marie (+after 1228), dau.of Raymond, constable of Tripoli
2 CONT ****D1. Guillaume V, chatelain de Saint-Omer, etc, *ca 1171, +after III.1245; m.1218 Imagina von Looz
2 CONT ****D2. Guillaume VI, chatelain de Saint-Omer, etc, fl 1248
2 CONT ****D3. Gautier de Saint-Omer, a canon, +k.a.in the Holy Land ca 1218
