2 CONC r 1223), wife firstly of Emperor Isaac II Angelos, secondly of King Boniface I of Thessalonica and thirdly of Nicolas of Saint-Omer King Andrew II of Hungary (c. 1177 – 21 September 1235) Constance (c. 1180 – 6 December 1240), wif
2 CONC e of king Ottokar I of Bohemia [edit]Sources
