2 CONT Andreas II Arpád, King of Hungary (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #104649, b. 1176, d. 7 March 1235
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=19 Nov 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT      Andreas II Arpád, King of Hungary was born in 1176. (3) He was the son of Béla III Arpád, King of Hungary and Agnes de Châtillon. (2) He married, secondly, Yolande de Courtney, daughter of Peter de Courtenay, Emperor of Const
2 CONC antinople and Yolande de Hainaut, before 29 January 1216. (4) He married, thirdly, Beatrice d'Este, daughter of Aldobrandino I, Marchese d'Este, in 1234. (3) He married, fourthly, Gertrud of Meran, daughter of Berthold II of Meran
2 CONC  , Duke of Meran. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 7 March 1235.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Andreas II Arpád, King of Hungary gained the title of King Andreas II of Hungary in 1205. (2)
