2 CONC  money to recruit followers among the barons and also sought the assistance of Leopold V, Duke of Austria. In December 1197, Andrew's troops defeated King Emeric's armies in a battle near to Macsek in December 1197. Following Andr
2 CONC ew's victory, the king was obliged to transfer the government of the Duchies of Croatia and Dalmatia to Andrew.
2 CONT
