2 CONT Baron Louis [II] had one possible illegitimate child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >c)          [BONNE de Savoie (-2 Mar or May 1342).  Bonne [Guta] is named in Europäische Stammtafeln[421] as the legitimate daughter of Louis de Vaud and as wife of the two husbands shown here, but the primary source on which thi
2 CONC s is based has not yet been identified.  She is not named in the 29 Mar 1340 testament of her father[422].  It is unlikely that the wife of Duke Bolko II could have been the legitimate daughter of Louis [II] Baron de Vaud: her son
2 CONC  was born in [1322/27] when the legitimate children of Baron Louis must still have been under child-bearing age.  m firstly MATTHIAS Graf von Trenczin, son of --- (-1318).  m secondly ([1321/22]) BOLKO II Duke of Münsterberg, son 
2 CONC of BOLKO I Duke of Jauer and Schweidnitz [Piast] & his wife Beatrix von Brandenburg [Askanier] ([1 Feb 1300/1301]-11 Jun 1341).] 
