2 CONC s a beneficiary under the 29 Mar 1340 testament of her brother Louis II Baron de Vaud[427], although according to Europäische Stammtafeln she died in 1338[428].  An agreement between "Beatrisina di Savoia Vedova di Gaufredo Signor
