1 NOTE Leopold I Duke of Austria, son of Albert I, was rival emperor for the Empire of Austria of Louis IV of Bavaria.  He was made Duke of Styria and Austria.  He died in 1326.
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Leopold I of Austria became co-Regent of the Empire of Austria in 1308, following the death of his father, Albert I.  He was regent until 1326 for Albert II.
1 NOTE DUKE OF AUSTRIA 1298-1326
