2 CONT b)         ISABELLE Ibelin ([1285]-).  The Lignages d'Outremer name (in order) "Gui, Marie, Ysabeau et Marguerite" as the four children of Balian son of "Gui l'autre fis Johan de Ybelin…conestable de Chipre" & his wife, stating th
2 CONC at Isabelle married "Johan de Ybelin, sire d'Arsur"[736].  This is confirmed by another passage of the Lignages d'Outremer which names "Ysabeau, la fille Balian de Ybelin, seneschal de Chipre" as the wife of Jean Ibelin of Arsur[7
2 CONC 37].  
