2 CONT # ''The Turks in Iran and Anatolia before the Mongol Invasions'', Claude Cahen, A History of the Crusades, Vol.2, Ed. Robert Lee Wolff and Harry W. Hazard, (The University of Wisconsin Press, 1969), 680-681.
