2 CONC records that "Ioannem…Raulem, protovestiarii Raulis filium" was created "protovestiarium" by Emperor Mikhael VIII (in [1261/62])[617].  He served the emperor in his campaigns to reincorporate Epirus and Thessaly into the empire[61
2 CONC 8].  
