2 CONT BENEDETTO [I] Zaccaria, son of FULCONE Zaccaria & his [first/second] wife [Giulietta ---/Beatrice ---] (-1307).  ... m (after 1275) [--- Palaiologina, daughter of ANDRONIKOS Dukas Komnenos Palaiologos megas domestikos & his wife T
