2 CONT *1.         PALEOLOGO Zaccaria (-1314).  He succeeded his father in 1307 as Lord of Chios.  m GIACOMINA Spinola, daughter of ---.  Paleologo & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT **a)         BENEDETTO Zaccaria (-1330).  He succeeded his father in 1314 as joint Lord of Chios, jointly with his brother.  He acted against his brother Martino during the 1329 uprising in Chios[458].  He unsuccessfully attempted
2 CONC  to recapture Chios in 1335[459], although this date contradicts the date of his death given in Sturdza[460].  m GINEVRA Doria, daughter of CORRADO Doria & his wife --- (-after 1340). 
2 CONT **b)         '''MARTINO Zaccaria''' (-beheaded Smyrna 15 Jan 1345).  He succeeded his father in 1314 as joint Lord of Chios, jointly with his brother.  He succeeded the family la Roche as baron of Damala in Argolis, and the family
2 CONC  of La Trémoïlle at Chalandritza[461].  He was called "King and Despot of Asia Minor" by Philippe of Sicily Prince of Tarento [Anjou-Capet] in 1325.  The Greek inhabitants of Chios, led by Leo Kalothetos, rebelled against his rule
2 CONC  in 1329.  The emperor intervened, captured Martino Zaccaria and imprisoned him in Constantinople[462].  He was captured by Turks while attending mass in the cathedral of Smyrna and beheaded in the courtyard outside, his head bein
2 CONC g presented as a trophy to Omar beg of Aydin[463].  m firstly --- Ghisi Lady of ½ Chalandritza, daughter of GIORGIO [I] Ghisi Lord of Mykonos & his [first wife --- de Dramelay].  m secondly JACQUELINE de la Roche Lady of Veligosti
2 CONC  and Damala, daughter of ---.  Martino & his [first/second] wife had two children: 
2 CONT ***i)          BARTOLOMEO Zaccaria (-[1334]).  Lord of Damala and Marchese of Boudonitza 1327-1334.  m (1327) as her first husband, GUGLIELMA Pallavicini Marchesa of Boudonitza, daughter of ALBERTO Pallavicini & his wife --- (-135
2 CONC 8).  She married secondly (1335, separated) as his second wife, Nicolò Giorgi [Zorzi].  -         MARCHESI of BOUDONITZA. 
2 CONT ***ii)         CENTURIONE Zaccaria (-1382).  Baron of Arkadia.  -         LORDS of ARKADIA. 
2 CONT **c)         GIOVANNI Zaccaria (-1359).  m ---.  The name of Giovanni's wife is not known.  Giovanni & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT ***i)          MANUELE Zaccaria .  1350. 
2 CONT *2.         ELIANA Zaccaria .  m ANDRIOLO Cattaneo "Paleologo", son of ANDRIOLO Cattaneo della Volta & his wife --- (-1331).  Governor of Phocea 1307.  Lord of Phocea 1314.  Andriolo & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT **a)         DOMENICO Cattaneo (-1336).  Lord of Phocea 1331.  He was expelled by the Byzantines in 1335. 
2 CONT *3.         MANUELE Zaccaria .  1300. 
