2 CONT
2 CONT Mawsillu was a Turcoman tribe active in Aq Qoyunlu confederation and Safavid Empire.
2 CONT
2 CONT History According to Turkish historian Tufan Gündüz and John E. Woods, they one of the three biggest tribes dominating Aq Qoyunlu along with Purnak and Bayandur tribes.[1] Their main controlled areas were near Diyarbakr and Armeni
2 CONC a. They supported Hamza beg (a son of Qara Yuluq Osman) and Sheykh Hasan at earliest times but later changed their allegiance to Uzun Hasan after 1451 during Aq Qoyunlu succession crisis.[2] They acquired the city of Ruha in later
2 CONC  in 1475 following the defeat of Uways (brother of Uzun Hasan).
2 CONT
2 CONT Famous members  : .Begtash beg Mawsillu — founder of the clan. .Osman (d. 1436) . see https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mawsillu
