2 CONT
2 CONT Duimo (Duym) II Frangepán, Ct of Veglia, fl 1280-1316; m.Ursa N (de Vodiča = Babonic = Blagay) (+before 16.10.1343); They had issue: 
2 CONT *A1. Frigyes IV, Ct of Veglia, Vindol, Modrus and Gačka, fl 1306-22; m.before 1313 Erzsébet N (+after 1315) 
2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT **B2. Bertalan V, Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Somogyi főispán (obergespan of Somogy), fl 1334-61; m.NN, sister of Ulrich N 
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT ***C4. János V, Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Ban of Croatia and Dalmatia, +29.11.1393; m.23.5.1361 Anna von Görz (+5.9.1402) 
2 CONT ****D1. Miklós IV, Cte of Veglia, Zengg and Modrus, Ban of Croatia and Dalmatia, +26.6.1432; 1m: Dorottya Garai de Gara (fl 1409-24); 2m: Márta Újlaki (fl 1426-42), dau.of Imre Újlaki, Ban of Macso and Katalin N 
2 CONT ***** ...
2 CONT *****E3. [1m.] István II (Stepko), Ct of Veglia and Modrus, Ban of Croatia, +1.3.1481; m.1446 Isotta d'Este (*1425 +1456) 
2 CONT ******F1. Bernardino (Bernát), Ct of Veglia and Modrus, +3.11.1527; m.before 16.9.1476 Donna Luisa Marzano d'Aragona 
