2 CONT Contarini x Giustiniani anno 1416 ( Benedetto fu Luca x Giustiniana di Andrea )       Branch San Cassan ,  carta 453
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1447 : Girolamo & Ambrosio * di Benedetto qu Luca  ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Paolo Paruta qu Bartolommeo & Andrea De Molin qu Nicolo )
2 CONT
2 CONT     1) Ambrogio di Benedetto entered Great Council on 30.10.1448 as avogador piccoli , his father testifies his age
2 CONT          Ambrogio di Benedetto is bowman on galley for Alexandria on 23.09.1449
2 CONT          Ambrogio di Benedetto is bowman on galley for Beirut on 18.09.1450
2 CONT          Ambrogio qu Benedetto was patronus of galley for Barbaria anno 1468 , see incanto on 18.01.1467
2 CONT          He is patronus of a galley for Aigues Mortes anno 1469 , see incanto on 09.01.1468
2 CONT          He was podesta Vicenza on 17.12.1481
2 CONT          He is proveditor sopra rippis Atticis on 23.09.1483
2 CONT          He is proveditor Valcamonica on 16.02.1483 , see Senato Terra
2 CONT          He is patronus of Arsenale on 01.12.1484
2 CONT          Ambrogio qu Benedetto is consul in Alexandria on 06.05.1490 , he was patronus of Arsenale on primo decembris 1484
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 29.09.1494
2 CONT          He is in Senate on 29.08.1495
2 CONT          Ambrogio qu Benedetto is consigliere Cyprus on 01.08.1496 , he was podesta Vicenza anno 1481
2 CONT
2 CONT         Contarini x Crespo anno 1479 ( Ambrosio fu Benedetto x Margherita fu Francesco vidua Marco Querini )
2 CONT
2 CONT          See Treccani . it for the biography of Ambrogio
2 CONT
2 CONT          See : Ambrogio Contarini di Benedetto is the ambassador sent to the sjah of Persia , see his book published in " Travels to Tana and Persia "
2 CONT
2 CONT          No offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT     2) Girolamo di Benedetto is bowman on galley for Alexandria , on 30.08.1448 , his father testifies
2 CONT         Girolamo di Benedetto entered Great Council on 07.08.1449 aged XXV , tt. are Andrea Contarini qu Donato & Giacomo Negro who is a scribe on the galleys
2 CONT         Girolamo di Benedetto is bowman on galley Beirut on 20.07.1451
2 CONT         Girolamo qu Benedetto is patronus of a galley for Alexandria anno 1457 , incanto on 07.05.1457
2 CONT         Girolamo is patronus of a galley for Alexandria anno 1459 , see incanto on 11.05.1459
2 CONT
2 CONT        No offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1449 : Agostino di Benedetto qu Luca  ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giovanni Dandolo qu Benedetto & Alvise Lambardo qu Bartolommeo )
2 CONT     3) Agostino di Benedetto is bowman on nave Bemba on 05.08 , tt. are Andrea Contarini qu Donato & Giacomo Negro who is scribe on the galley , on 05.08.1449
2 CONT         Agostino di Benedetto is bowman on navus Falascho on 18.07.1450
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedeto entered Great Council on 21.03.1455 after Barbarella of year 1451
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedetto is witness on 22.11.1460 at balla d'oro of Giacomo Contarini di Francesco qu Agostino
2 CONT         He is sopracomito in the Armada of the Pope , elected on 03.03.1472 , see Sanudo in Vite dei Dogi
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedetto is sopracomito elected in Senate on 07.12.1472
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedetto is patronus of galley for Jaffa , see Notariato on 21.07.1481
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedetto is patronus of galley for Jaffa on 01.06.1482
2 CONT         Agostino qu Benedetto is patronus of a galley for Jaffa anno 1495 *
2 CONT
2 CONT         He was known as Agostino Contarini dal Zaffo
2 CONT
2 CONT Red. : Agostino Contarini di Benedetto is mentioned in Canon Pietro Casola's Pelgrimage to Jerusalem anno 1494 . He told Casola that he had been at sea for 42 years
2 CONT He was patronus of a galley for the pilgrims almost every year
2 CONT
2 CONT       No offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT      This branch is extinct anno 1500
2 CONT
2 CONT Also : Contarini x Contarini anno 1441 ( Andrea fu Donato x Caterina di Benedetto )
