2 CONT Contarini x Corner anno 1435 ( Tommaso di Pietro di Paolo x Elisabetta di Giorgio )       Carta 515                   Branch Sta Maria Zubenigo
2 CONT
2 CONT Giorgio became count Zaffa , was invested by his Catharina Corner , queen of Cyprus
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1463 : Giorgio * & Paolo di Tommaso qu Pietro  ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Girolamo Michiel qu Nicolo & Francesco Foscarini di Giovanni )    
2 CONT
2 CONT     1) Paolo di Tommaso entered Great Council on 05.12.1468 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         Paolo da Santa Maria Zubenigo is among the 3 capi di credotori of banco Lippomano on 01.06.1499
2 CONT         Paolo is one of the 2 capi di creditori of the Banco Lippomano anno 1503 , see Sanudo V. 171 a.o. on 15.10.1503
2 CONT         He is among the 12 nobles to inspect the borders of the Laguna on 02.06.1509
2 CONT         He is a witness at balla d'oro of Pietro Dona qu Alvise qu Giovanni anno 1510
2 CONT
2 CONT         Contarini x Dandolo anno 1498 ( Paolo qu Tommaso x donna qu Natale qu Nicolo )   He was ' zotto '
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + 26.01.1513 , he owned a diamond worth 12.000 ducats coming from his uncle Marino Contarini and nobody knows where this diamond is
2 CONT
2 CONT         Paolo qu Tommaso da Santa Maria Zubenigo , he is married but has no children , he has nephews who are sons of his brother Giorgio
2 CONT
2 CONT         No offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT     2) Giorgio di Tommaso entered Great Council on 23.03.1472 aged XXV .
2 CONT         Giorgio becomes conte Zaffo , he starts the Contarini dell Zaffo branch
2 CONT         He is elected ambassador to Spain on 10.04.1495 , see Registro Mar 1494 - 1500 carta 59 V
