2 CONT 5.         '''ERSZÉBET''' (1236-24 Oct 1271, bur Kloster Seligenthal).  The Altahenses Annales record the marriage of "Heinricus filius O. ducis Bavarie" and "Elisabeth filia Bele regis Ungarie"[947].  The Altahenses Annales recor
2 CONC d the death "1271 IX Kal Nov" of "Elizabeth ducissa Bawarie"[948].  The necrology of Tegernsee records the death "IX Kal Nov" of "Elysabeth ducissa Bawarie filia regis Ungarie"[949].  The necrology of Windberg records the death "I
2 CONC X Kal Nov 1271" of "Elysabet ducissa Bawarie"[950].  The necrology of Seligenthal records the death "IX Kal Nov 1271" of "domina Elizabet filia regis Ungarie ducissa Bawarie"[951].  
