2 CONT '''m''' (1250) HEINRICH von Bayern, son of OTTO II "der Erlauchte" Duke of Bavaria & his wife Agnes von Sachsen [Este] (Landshut 19 Nov 1235-Burghausen 3 Feb 1290, bur Kloster Seligenthal).  He succeeded his father in 1253 as HEIN
2 CONC RICH I Joint-Duke of Bavaria, jointly with his brother Ludwig II.  He and his older brother divided the family's territories in 1255, whereupon Heinrich became Duke of Lower Bavaria (Niederbayern). 
