2 CONT Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich (1)  M, #113920, b. 1072, d. 1136 Last Edited=16 Jul 2005
2 CONT      Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich was born in 1072.2 He was the son of Leopold II Markgraf von Österreich and Ida of Cham. (2) He married Agnes Salian, daughter of Heinrich IV, Holy Roman Emperor, in 1106. (2)  
2 CONC He died in 1136. (2)
2 CONT      Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich was a member of the House of Babenberg. (3) He succeeded to the title of Markgraf von Österreich in 1095. (3) Children of Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich and Agn
2 CONC es Salian -1. Adalbert Babenberg b. 1107, d. 1137 (2) -2. Leopold IV Herzog von Bayern b. 1108, d. 1141 (2) -3. Otto Babenberg b. 1109, d. 1158 (2) -4. Agnes Babenberg+ b. 1111, d. 1157 (2) -5. Heinrich II Jasomirgott Herzog von Ö
2 CONC sterreich+ b. 1114, d. 1177 (2) -6. Conrad Babenberg b. 1120, d. 1168 (2) -7. Gertrud Babenberg+ b. 1129, d. 1150 (1)
2 CONT
