1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Vladislaus II of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT By his first wife, Gertrude of Babenberg (died 4 August 1150), he had the following issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick, successor
2 CONT
2 CONT Sviatopluk, married a daughter of Geza II of Hungary
2 CONT
2 CONT Vojtech, archbishop of Salzburg as Adalbert III
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes (died 7 June 1228), abbess of St George of Prague
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertrud Babenberg (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #113919, b. 1129, d. 1150
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=19 Aug 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gertrud Babenberg was born in 1129. (1) She was the daughter of Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich and Agnes Salian. (1), (2) She married Vladislav I, King of Bohemia, son of Vladislav I, Duke of Bohemia and Rixa
2 CONC  von Berg, in 1140. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1150. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Gertrud Babenberg and Vladislav I, King of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Adalbert of Bohemia d. 1200 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Svatopluk of Bohemia d. a 1169 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Friedrich, King of Bohemia+ d. 1189 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
