2 CONC ror Friedrich I tried to reach a compromise with the Welfs and endowed the son of Henry the Proud, Henry the Lion, with Bavaria in 1156. A replacement had to be found for the Babenberg family, namely the Privilegium Minus, by whic
2 CONC h Austria was elevated to a duchy and gained complete independence from Bavaria.
2 CONT
