2 CONT Henry II of Austria succeeded his brother, Leopold IV as Margrave and Sovereign of the Empire of Austria in 1141.  He ruled until 1156 as Margrave.  The Empire was created a duchy in 1156 and he ruled as Duke Henry II.until 1177.
