2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT Gisela (Gille) of Burgundy-Ivrea Countess of Burgundy-Ivrea
2 CONT Daughter of Guillaume I "the Great" de Bourgogne Comte de Franche,Burgundy, Macon (1024-1087) and Stephanie of BARCELONA (1045-1092)
2 CONT
2 CONT   b. Abt 1060, Bourgogne, France
2 CONT   d. 1133
2 CONT
2 CONT Married first Humbert II of SAVOY Count of Murienne and Savoy(1062-1103). He was son of Amadeo II Count of SAVOY (1032-1080) and Joande GENEVA (1034-)
2 CONT
2 CONT   b. ABT 1062
2 CONT   r. Savoie, France
2 CONT   d. 17 Oct 1103
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Alix (Adelaide) of SAVOY Queen of France Countess of Savoy (1092-1154)
2 CONT Amadeo III of SAVOY Count of Savoy (1092-1148) m. Maud (Mathilde)Countess of ALBON (1116-1145)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married second Rainer of MONTFERRAT Marquis of Montferrat (1055-)
