2 CONT Béatrice, Countess of Albon and Dauphine of Viennois (1161-1228) became countess and dauphine in 1162 upon the death of her father Guigues V.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hugh III, Duke of Burgundy in 1183 and had three children:
2 CONT
2 CONT André Guigues VI (1184 - 1237), Dauphin of Viennois
2 CONT
2 CONT Mahaut (1190 - 1242), married in 1214 John I, Count of Châlon and Auxonne (1190 - 1267)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne (1192 - 1243), married in 1222 Amadeus IV (1197 - 1253), Count of Savoy
