2 CONC  Vaqueiras himself calls her "filha del marques" in the famous 'Carros', 'Truan, mala guerra', composed in [1200/01], which emphasises her youth[178].  The identity of her husband "Enric del Caret" has not been established, assumi
2 CONC ng that the marriages of Enrico [II] di Caretto are correct as shown below in this document.  
