2 CONT [edit] Second marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT After he was widowed, he married Joan, Countess of Ponthieu, before August 1237. They had four sons and one daughter:
2 CONT  1.Ferdinand (1239–1260), Count of Aumale
2 CONT  2.Eleanor (c.1241–1290), married Edward I of England
2 CONT  3.Louis (1243–1269)
2 CONT  4.Simon (1244), died young and buried in a monastery in Toledo
2 CONT  5.John (1245), died young and buried at the cathedral in Córdoba
