1 NOTE Fernando III
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=41da6a8e-6f0b-4220-bc0f-6b281a1e87e3&tid=2456826&pid=78703653
1 NOTE [lancaster cd 38 42 46 49 88.FTW]
