2 CONT *Mother	Isabel of Swabia1 b. bt Mar 1205 - May 1205, d. 5 Nov 1235
2 CONT *'''     Philip, Seigneur de Valdecorneja, Bishop of Seville married Leonor Rodriguez de Castro''', daughter of Ruy Fernandez de Castro and Leonor Gonzalez de Lara, '''DID NOT MARRY.2 Philip, Seigneur de Valdecorneja, Bishop of Se
2 CONC ville was born after 1231.1 He died on 28 November 1274'''.1
