2 CONT Euphrosyne / Ефросина Mstislavsdatter / Мстиславна of Kiev / Арпад, of Kiev (Рюриковна)  (1130 - 1186)
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphrosine of Novgorod 
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 1130, d. before 1186
2 CONT
2 CONT      Euphrosine of Novgorod was born circa 1130. (1) She was the daughter of Mstislaw I, Grand Prince of Kiev. (1) She married Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary, son of Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary and Helen of Serbia, in 1146. (1
2 CONC ) She died before 1186. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Euphrosine of Novgorod and Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Elisabeth Arpád+ d. a 1190 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Helen Arpád+ d. 1199 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary b. 1147, d. 1172 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Béla III Arpád, King of Hungary+ b. 1148, d. c 1196 (1)
2 CONT
