2 CONT =Evfrosiniya Princess Of Kiev [Queen Of Hungary]=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Evfrosiniya Princess Of Kiev''' [Queen Of Hungar-16780 [Parents] was born in 1130 in Of, Kiev, Kiev, Ukraine. She died in 1186 in , Byzantium, , Turkey. She was buried in , Szekesfehervar, Fejer, Hungary. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[Evfrosiniya's Parents]===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mstislav I, Grand Kiev
2 CONT * Lyubava Dmitrievna [Grand Duchess O]
2 CONT
2 CONT *She married '''Geza II (Masodik Hungary'''-16779 in 1146. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT #    M i Istvan III, King Hungary-16781 was born in 1147. He died on 4 Mar 1172.  
2 CONT #    M ii Bela III (Harmadik Hungary-16782 was born in 1148. He died on 23 Apr 1196.  
2 CONT #    F iii Erszebet, Princess Of Hungary-16783 was born about 1149. She died after 12 Jan 1189.  
2 CONT #    M iv Mr. Geza, Prince Of Hungary-16784 was born about 1152 in Of, Esztergom, Komarom-Esztergo, Hungary. He died about 1210.  
2 CONT #    M v Mr. Arpad, Prince Of Hungary-16785 was born about 1154 in Of, Esztergom, Komarom-Esztergo, Hungary. He died .  
2 CONT #    F vi Odola, Princess Of Hungary-16786 was born about 1156. She died .  
2 CONT #    F vii Miss Ilona, Princess Of Hungary-16708 was born about 1158. She died on 25 Dec 1199.  
2 CONT #    F viii Margit, Princess Of Hungary-16787 was born about 1160. She died .  
2 CONT #    F ix Heilwich van Hongarije-62169 was born about 1146. She died about 1170.  
2 CONT #    F x Elisabeth van Hongarije-59725 was born about 1147. She died about 1190.  
2 CONT #    M xi Stephan III van Hongarije-62157 was born in 1147. He died on 4 Mar 1172.  
2 CONT #    F xii Helena van Hongarije-62162 was born about 1158. She died on 25 May 1199.  
2 CONT #    F xiii Elisabeth Arpad Hungary-97590 died in 1190 .  
