2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Géza (c. 1150 – before 1210). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arpad, died young. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Odola (1156 – 1199), wife of Duke Sviatopluk of Bohemia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena (c. 1158 – 25 May 1199), wife of Duke Leopold V of Austria. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret (Margit) (1162 – ?), born posthumously; wife firstly of Isaac Macrodukas and secondly of András, Obergespan of Somogy.
