2 CONT
2 CONT # 1146: Euphrosyne of Kiev (c. 1130 – c. 1193), daughter of Grand Prince Mstislav I of Kiev and his second wife, Liubava Dmitrievna
2 CONT
2 CONT King Stephen III of Hungary (1147 – 4 March 1172). 
2 CONT
2 CONT King Béla III of Hungary (1148 – 23 April 1196). 
2 CONT
