2 CONT * ...
2 CONT *A5. Obizzo I d'Este, Mgve di Este (1173-93), Mgve of Genoa and Milan (1184-93), Podesta of Padua, etc, +ca 1193; 1m: NN; 2m: Sophia da Landanara
2 CONT **B1. [probably by 1m.] Azzo V d'Este, *ca 1130, +1193
2 CONT ***C1. Azzo VI d'Este, Marquis of Ferrara (1196-1212) =Azzo I, Lord of Padua & Verona, etc, Mgve of Ancona, Ct of Loreto, *ca 1170, +XI.1212; 1m: N, a dau.of Cte Aldebrandino; 2m: Sophie of Savoy (*1165 +3.12.1202); 3m: 22.2.1204 
2 CONC Alix de Chatillon (+1235) dau.of Pr Raimond of Antioch
