1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Adélaïs (Alix) de Bourgogne was the daughter of Hugues IV de Bourgogne, Duc de Bourgogne and Yolande de Dreux. She married Henri III de Brabant, Duc de Brabant, son of  Henri II, Duc de Brabant and Marie von Hohens
2 CONC taufen. She died on 23 October 1273.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Alix de Bourgogne and Henri III de Brabant, Duc de Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean I de Brabant, Duc de Brabant+ b. c 1251, d. 4 May 1294
2 CONT
