2 CONT Marie de Brabant1
2 CONT
2 CONT F,  b. 1256, d. 12 January 1321
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie de Brabant was born in 1256 at Louvain, Belgium.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Henri III de Brabant, Duc de Brabant and Alix de Bourgogne.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Philippe III, Roi de France, son of Louis IX, Roi de France and Marguerite de Provence, on 23 August 1274. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 12 January 1321. She was buried at Paris, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Marie de Brabant and Philippe III, Roi de France
2 CONT
