2 CONT  b. 1256,
2 CONT
2 CONT  d. 12 January 1321
2 CONT
2 CONT      Marie de Brabant was born in 1256 at Louvain, Belgium. She was the daughter of Henri III de Brabant, Duc de Brabant and Alix de Bourgogne.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Philippe III, Roi de France, son of Louis IX, Roi de France 
2 CONT
2 CONT and Marguerite de Provence, on 23 August 1274.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died on 10 January 1321. She was buried at Paris, France.
