2 CONT Margaret of England1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, b. 11 September 1275, d. 1318
2 CONT
2 CONT |p10486.htm#i104856|
2 CONT
2 CONT      Margaret of England was born on 11 September 1275 at Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She was the daughter of Edward I 'Longshanks', King of England and Eleanor de Castilla, Comtesse de Ponthieu. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean II de Brabant, Duc de Brabant, son of Jean I de Brabant, Duc de Brabant and Marguerite de Flandre, on 8 July 1290 at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, London, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died in 1318 at Brussels, Belgium.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She was buried at Collegiate Church of St. Gudule, Brussels, Belgium.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret of England and Jean II de Brabant, Duc de Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Jean III de Brabant, Duc de Brabant+3 b. 1300, d. 5 Dec 1355
2 CONT
