2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of England (1275–1333)
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of England (1275–1333) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Duchess of Brabant, Lothier and Limburg 
2 CONT
2 CONT Tenure 3 May 1294 – 27 October 1312 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse John II, Duke of Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT m. 1290; dec. 1312 
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue 
2 CONT
2 CONT John III, Duke of Brabant 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Edward I Longshanks 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Eleanor of Castile 
2 CONT
