2 CONT 1.         BOHEMOND of Antioch ([1144]-[20 Mar/1 Oct] 1201).  The Lignages d'Outremer name "Beymont et Marguerite" as the two children of "Reimont le fill au comte de Poitiers" & his wife[168].  He succeeded his mother in 1163 as 
2 CONC BOHEMOND III "le Bègue" Prince of Antioch.  -        see below. 
