2 CONT Sibylle N (married 1180/1181, probably divorced ca 1199) 
2 CONT Alix de Poitiers (died 1233), married 1204 Guy I Embriaco, lord of Gibelet (d. ca 1233) 
2 CONT Guillaume de Poitiers, fl. 1194 
2 CONT Isabelle N (married ca 1199) 
2 CONT Bohemond de Poitiers, Lord Consort of Boutron (died 1244), married N Plivane, the Heiress and Lady of Boutron, and had issue (they adopted their mother's title de Boutron as surname): 
2 CONT Jean de Boutron (d. in prison aft. October 18, 1244 
2 CONT Guillaume de Boutron, Lord of Boutron, Constable of Jerusalem, fl. 1262, married Agnes de Sidon-Sagette, daughter of Balian of Sidon, and had issue, one son: 
2 CONT Jean de Boutron, Lord of Boutron (d. 1277) (1258-1277), married c. 1258 Lucie Embriaco de Giblet, without issue 
2 CONT Jacques de Boutron, married Clarence Hazart, and had: 
2 CONT Rostain de Boutron, Lord of Boutron (1282) 
2 CONT Guillaume de Boutron 
2 CONT Alix de Boutron, married Guillaume de Farabel, Seigneur de Puy, Constable of Tripoli (1282) 
