2 CONT Eschive d'Ibelin (1160-1196/1197) was the daughter of Baldwin of Ibelin (died 1187), lord of Ramla, and of Richilde de Bethsan.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Amalric II of Lusignan (1145 - 1205), constable of the kingdom of Jerusalem, then king of Cyprus (1194-1205) and of Jerusalem (1197-1205). Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Bourgogne (1180 † 1210), married Raymond VI of Toulouse, then Gautier II de Montfaucon
2 CONT
2 CONT *Guy, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT *Jean, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT *Hugh I, king of Cyprus
2 CONT
2 CONT *Heloïse, married Raymond-Roupen of Antioch
2 CONT
2 CONT *Alix, died young
2 CONT
