2 CONT '''Balian of Ibelin''' (French: Balian d'Ibelin; c. 1143 – 1193), also known as '''Barisan the Younger''', was a crusader noble of the Kingdom of Jerusalem in the 12th century. He was lord of Ibelin from 1170 to 1193. As the leade
2 CONC r of the defense of the city during the siege of Jerusalem in 1187, he surrendered Jerusalem to [https://www.geni.com/people/Saladin-Yusuf-ibn-Ayyub/6000000003139247507 Saladin] on 2 October 1187. 
2 CONT
