2 CONT 3.         MARIE (1321-before 1405).  The Chronicle of Jean Dardel names "Marie" as the daughter of "le…baron Ossin" and his wife "Jehanne de Naples", stating that she married "[le] premier roy tyrant…Constant, filz de baron Baudi
2 CONC n, le grant mareschal du royaume, et ung des quatre gouverneurs"[1066].  
2 CONT
