1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * from [https://books.google.com/books?id=-FvJAwAAQBAJ&pg=PA39&lpg=PA39&dq=qaysar+shah&source=bl&ots=c8Fc3lmBo8&sig=d3slpiIzS9jr7spa061vo41BGvU&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiPzZDrworOAhVDGz4KHae5D7AQ6AEIPzAG#v=onepage&q=q
2 CONC aysar%20shah&f=false '''The Formation of Turkey: The Seljukid Sultanate of Rum Eleventh to Fourteenth Century'''] by Claude Cahen.
