2 CONC the death of his elder brother, 1590. m. (first) 30th August 1591, H.H. The Most Brilliant Princess Nestan-Darejan (d. in childbirth, ca. May 1592), eldest daughter of H.M. The Most High King Aleksandri II, King of Kakheti, by his
2 CONC  wife, H.M. The Most High Queen Tinatina, daughter of His Splendour The Pious Prince of High Rank Bardzim I Amilakhvari. m. (second) 1592, Her Splendour The Pious Princess of High Rank Thamar (b. 18th April 1561), widow of The Nob
2 CONC le Kaikhushru Oraviandashvili and of His Splendour The Pious Prince of High Rank Vakhtang Gurieli, Duke of the Guria, and younger daughter of His Splendour The Pious Prince of High Rank Kaikhushru II Jageli, Atabegi of Samtzkhé, b
2 CONC y his wife, Princess Dédis-Imédi, younger daughter of His Splendour The Pious Prince of High Rank Vakhtang I, 2nd Prince of Mukhrani. He d. in a hunting accident, at Zugdidi, Mingrelia, 1611, having had issue, four sons and three 
2 CONC daughters
