2 CONT
2 CONT =References=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Brosset, Marie-Félicité (1856). ''Histoire de la Géorgie depuis l'Antiquité jusqu'au XIXe siècle. IIe partie. Histoire moderne [History of Georgia from Antiquity to the 19th century. Part II. Modern History]'' (in French). S.-Pé
2 CONC tersbourg: A la typographie de l'Academie Impériale des Sciences.
2 CONT * Gelashvili, Nana (2012). "Iranian–Georgian Relations during the Reign of Rostom (1633–58)". In Floor, Willem; Herzig, Edmund. ''Iran and the World in the Safavid Age.'' London: I.B.Tauris. ISBN 1850439303.
2 CONT * Lang, David Marshall (1957). ''The Last Years of the Georgian Monarchy, 1658-1832.'' New York: Columbia University Press.
2 CONT * Maeda, Hirotake (2012). "Slave Elites Who Returned Home: Georgian Vali-king Rostom and the Safavid Household Empire". ''Memoirs of the Research Department of the Toyo Bunko'' 69: 97–127.
2 CONT * Rapp, Stephen H. (2003). ''Studies in Medieval Georgian Historiography: Early Texts And Eurasian Contexts.'' Leuven: Peeters Publishers. ISBN 90-429-1318-5.
2 CONT * Rayfield, Donald (2012). ''Edge of Empires: A History of Georgia''. London: Reaktion Books. ISBN 1780230303.
