2 CONT
2 CONT =Juraj IV Zrinski, Treasurer of Croatia=1
2 CONT M, b. 13 April 1549, d. 4 May 1603
2 CONT * Father Nikola IV Subic Zrinski, Ban of Croatia & Slavonia, Treasurer of Hungary1 b. c 1508, d. 8 Sep 1566 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mother Katarina Frangepan1 d. b 20 Jun 1561  Juraj IV Zrinski, Treasurer of Croatia was born on 13 April 1549.1 He married Sophia von Stubenberg after 1570.1 Juraj IV Zrinski, Treasurer of Croatia died on 4 May 1603 at Vép, Szom
2 CONC bathely, Vas, West Transdanubia, Hungary, at age 54; Buried at monastery of St. Helena near Cakovec.1
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT Sophia von Stubenberg  
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Child===
