1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/antonio-marcello_(Dizionario-Biografico)/
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/BO/B.O.III.M.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Marcello x Vendramin circa 1447 ( Antonio di Donato x Helena di Luca qu Bartolommeo )    Carta 483                      Antonio detto " porretto " da San Pantalon
2 CONT
2 CONT Antonio Marcello di Donato is podesta & capitano Crema anno 1480
2 CONT
2 CONT He + anno 1491
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 sons married , 5 of them have offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT The last descendants lived in San Giovanni Decollato , extinct in 2d part of 18th century
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1469 : Girolamo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Girolamo Morosini qu Bernardo & Alvise Vendramin di Andrea Procurator )                   
2 CONT     1) Girolamo enters Great Council on 17.05.1470 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         He is on the XL criminalis on 13.04.1480
2 CONT         He is judex forinsecori on 08.01.1483
2 CONT         Girolamo qu Antonio is pledge for his brother Sebastiano on 13.02.1496
2 CONT         Girolamo qu Antonio is among guests of the new Doge Antonio Grimani on 09.07.1521
2 CONT         He is among guests of Andrea Gritti on 21.05.1523
2 CONT         He is at election for senator on 21.07.1527
2 CONT         Girolamo qu Antonio poreto is in Great Council on 31.07.1527 after absence of 20 years
2 CONT
2 CONT         Marcello x Loredan anno 1481 ( Girolamo di Antonio di Donato x Giovanna di Paolo qu Francesco )
2 CONT
2 CONT        Decima 1514 .  San Pantalon . 63 . Estimo of 40 ducats  
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1472 : Pietro ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Girolamo Morosini qu Bernardo & Francesco Zorzi qu Pietro )                  
2 CONT     2) Pietro di Antonio enters Great Council on 10.05.1475 after the Barbarella , tt. are Filippo Vendramin qu Luca & Lorenzo Priuli di Pietro
2 CONT         Pietro di Antonio is vicedominus fondaco tedeschi on 02.01.1476
2 CONT         Pietro qu Antonio is pledge for his brother Sebastiano on 13.02.1496
2 CONT         Pietro qu Antonio is pledge for his brother Giovanni Francesco as patronus of galley anno 1497
2 CONT         Pietro qu Antonio is guilty of usury , he gets a fine of 400 ducats , his nickname is ' Male Fin '
2 CONT         Pietro Marcello qu Antonio asks permission to print " certa opereta muona " on 07.06.1502
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + anno 1502
2 CONT
2 CONT          Marcello x Contarini anno 1478 ( Pietro di Antonio x Contarina fu Pietro vidua Pietro Zane )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1474 : Donato ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Benedetto Erizo - blanc space - & Girolamo Vendramin qu Antonio )
2 CONT     3) Donato entered Great Council on 05.06.1475 after the Barbarella
2 CONT          Donato qu Antonio is pledge for his brother Sebastiano on 13.02.1496
2 CONT          Donato qu Antonio is on X savi on 13.05.1503 , he is proveditor di comun
2 CONT          He is proveditor biave on 27.09.1507
2 CONT          He is on 12 senators to enroll men from different contrade in a militia , for sestieri Santa Croce , on 01.06.1509
2 CONT          He is senator on 29.09.1510
2 CONT          He is deputado sestieri Santa Croce on 12.09.1511
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1513
2 CONT          He is consiglieri ducale sestieri Santa Croce on 01.06.1514
2 CONT          He is elected luogotenente Cyprus on 13.08.1514  , é consier
2 CONT          He is at 5 savi sopra la mercandantia on 26.11.1517
2 CONT          He is elected in Dieci on 17.03.1518 instead of Luca Tron who got elected as consiglieri
2 CONT          He is capo Dieci on 01.04.1518
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1518
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1519
2 CONT          He is consiglieri ducale Santa Croce on 22.09.1520 , see Sanudo XXIX pagina 200
2 CONT          He joins the Doge Gritti to Murano on 17.05.1524 , the Doge is his cousin
2 CONT          He enters the Dieci novo on 01.10.1524 , he is capo on 01.12.1524
2 CONT          He is elected capitano Creta on 04.12.1524
2 CONT          He is capitano Creta on 06.03.1525 , see prove di eta
2 CONT
2 CONT          He + ante 16.04.1526 as capitano Candia , the Doge who is his relative went in mourning
2 CONT
2 CONT          Decima 1514 . San Giovanni Bragora . 15 . Estimo of 187 ducats , he owns 1/6th of casa stazio in San Pantalon
2 CONT
2 CONT         Marcello x Malipiero anno 1489 ( Donato di Antonio x Lucia fu Tommaso )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1475 : Sebastiano ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Cristoforo Duodo qu Luca & Girolamo Vendramin qu Antonio )                                 
2 CONT     4) Sebastiano entered Great Council on 02.01.1478 as avogador piccoli
2 CONT         He is off. tabula exitus on 12.02.1483
2 CONT         He builds a nave , see Senato Mar on 08.02.1496 , his 4 brothers are his pledge
2 CONT         He is at inspection of the contrade on 06.06.1509 for contrada Santa Sofia
2 CONT         He returned from Padua on 15.08.1509
2 CONT         He is at election for proveditor general in Armada on 30.11.1520 , his score is very bad with 22 / 154 votes
2 CONT         He is at election for proveditor sopra camere on 26.01.1522 , good score but not elected
2 CONT         He is among guests of Andrea Gritti on 21.05.1523
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + anno 1528 , see Sanudo 49 . 515
2 CONT
2 CONT         Marcello x Contarini anno 1484 ( Sebastiano qu Antonio x Lucia qu Pietro qu Marino qu Antonio Procurator )
2 CONT
2 CONT         Decima 1514 . Santa Sofia . 49  . Estimo of 26 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1482 : Giovanni Francesco ( sponsor is the father ,tt. are Giovanni Pisani qu Nicolo & Giacomo Lion qu Andrea Procurator )              
2 CONT     5) Giovanni Francesco entered Great Council on 20.10.1484 after the Barbarella
2 CONT          He is judex di proprio on 12.11.1494
2 CONT          Giovanni Francesco qu Antonio is patronus of galley for Alexandria anno 1497
2 CONT          He is camerlengo di comun on 29.07.1504
2 CONT          He is castellano Padua elected on 09.12.1509
2 CONT          He is serving proveditor sopra la sanita on 19.09.1512 , see Sanudo XV pagina 98
2 CONT          He is senator on 24.09.1514
2 CONT          He is elected to the Senate on 14.10.1515 , he is a substitute
2 CONT          He is senator on 22.09.1518
2 CONT          He is senator on 18.09.1519
2 CONT          He is senator on 25.08.1520
2 CONT          He is senator on 11.08.1521
2 CONT          He is proveditor salis on 23.12.1521
2 CONT          He is among guests of Andrea Gritti on 21.05.1523
2 CONT          He is senator on 01.10.1525
2 CONT          He is senator on 25.08.1527
2 CONT          He is in zonta Dieci on 01.10.1527
2 CONT
2 CONT          Marcello x Pesaro anno 1495 ( Giovanni Francesco fu Antonio fu Donato x Chiara fu Marco )
2 CONT
2 CONT           Decima 1514 .  San Pantalon . 63 . Estimo of 58 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 20.10.1484 : Andrea ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giovanni Benedetto & Paolo Orio di Pietro )                                                                        
2 CONT     6) Andrea entered Great Council on 10.01.1484 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         He is XL civilis on 27.09.1493
2 CONT         He is camerlengo Cyprus on 14.06.1494
2 CONT         He is XL criminalis on 07.09.1495
2 CONT         He is signori di notte sestieri Dorsoduro on 23.11.1496
2 CONT         He is XL civilis novissimo on 28.01.1496
2 CONT         Andrea qu Antonio is pledge for his brother Sebastiano on 13.02.1496
2 CONT         He is judex curia petition on 28.02.1496 , elected on the XL on 28.01.1496
2 CONT         He is off. camera imprestiti on 04.06.1505
2 CONT         He will go to defend Padua or Treviso with 10 soldiers at his own expense on 22.08.1511 , fo patron in Fiandra
2 CONT         He is capitano galleys Beirut elected on 22.04.1515 , see Sanudo XX pagina 135
2 CONT         Andrea qu Antonio  is elected senator on 16.08.1516 pro 300 ducats , fo razon novo
2 CONT         Andrea qu Antonio da San Pantalon failed at election for zonta on 30.09.1518
2 CONT         Andrea qu Antonio is elected for Senate on 22.07.1519 , see Sanudo XXVII
2 CONT         He is senator on 15.09.1521
2 CONT         He is on 5 savi sopra reformation di la terra on 03.04.1522
2 CONT         He is among guests of Andrea Gritti on 21.05.1523
2 CONT         He is senator on 01.10.1525
2 CONT         He is at election zonta Senate on 30.09.1526 , not elected with a good score
2 CONT         He is elected as proveditor sopra i banchi on 13.11.1526 with a very good score
2 CONT         He is senator elected on 18.08.1527
2 CONT         He is elected on X savi sopra reformation di la terra on 06.03.1528
2 CONT         He is elected in the zonta on 30.09.1528
2 CONT         He is member of the zonta X on 24.02.1529 in de materia di Savorgnani , see Sanudo LII
2 CONT         He enters zonta X on 09.01.1530 instead of Marino Corner
2 CONT         He is consier Dorsoduro elected on 12.02.1530 instead of the absent Sebastiano Foscarini  , see Sanudo LIV pagina 289
2 CONT         He is elected in zonta X on 01.10.1531 but cannot enter as Toma Contarini , his cugnado , entered the  Dieci
2 CONT         He is capitano Padua on 26.04.1532 , he was XL criminalis on 07.09.1495
2 CONT
2 CONT         Decima 1514 .  San Pantalon . 47 . Estimo of 28 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + anno 1556
2 CONT
2 CONT Also :  Da Lezze x Marcello anno 1468 ( Michele fu Donato x Maria Antonia di Antonio )
