2 CONT Zaccaria cavalier Procurator + anno 1492 , he is replaced on 13.12.1492
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1470 : Daniele di Zaccaria miles ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Luca Pisani qu Giovanni & Andrea Dandolo qu Benedetto )       
2 CONT      1) Daniele di Zacccaria miles entered Great Council on 25.09.1473 after the Barbarella
2 CONT          Daniele di Zaccaria miles  is sentenced by the X to 6 months in prison & 5 years ineligibility on 03.05.1478
2 CONT           Daniele di Zaccaria miles is XL criminalis on 09.05.1481 , the father is absent and gives procuration at Giacomo Balbi qu Bernardo
2 CONT           Daniele di Zaccaria eques is XL criminalis on 24.03.1484
2 CONT           Daniele di Zaccaria militis is savio ai ordine on 01.10.1486
2 CONT           Daniele qu Zaccaria eques Procurator is very ill and wants to join the Scuola Misericordia on 17.02.1496 , see Dieci Deliberazione Miste on pagina 117 V
2 CONT
2 CONT           Daniele asks permission to publish the work of his brother Rev. Ermolao  , ' eus castigationis Plinii ' on 11.12.1493 , see Notariato
2 CONT
2 CONT           Barbaro x Priuli anno 1479 ( Daniele di Zaccaria equitis x Andrianna di Francesco )    
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1471 : Ermolao *( sponsor is the father , tt. are Nicolo Barbaro di Marco & Giuliano Bollani qu Giovanni )  
2 CONT      2) Ermolao di Zaccaria miles entered Great Council on 25.09.1473 on same day as his brother Daniele after the Barbarella
2 CONT          He is auditor veteris on 05.04.1480
2 CONT          Ermolao doctor di Zaccaria is off. razon veteris on 22.05.1484
2 CONT          Ermolao doctor miles di Zaccaria miles Procurator is avogador di comun on 22.03.1490
2 CONT
2 CONT          He + anno 1497
2 CONT
2 CONT          * Ermolao is the famous humanist , he would die in Roma as patriarch of Aquileia
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1473 : difficult to read *  ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Bernardo Bembo qu Pietro Barbaro qu Donato )          Carta 201
2 CONT      * this should be Alvise
2 CONT
2 CONT      3) Alvise di Zaccaria militis entered Great Council on 18.12.1474 as avogador curia petition
2 CONT          Alvise was at XL criminale on 02.06.1488
2 CONT          Alvise qu Zaccaria eques is pledge for his brother-in-law Pietro Trevisan qu Andrea as patronus of  galley for Flanders anno 1499
2 CONT          Alvise qu Zaccaria eques is XL civilis novissimo on 23.04.1500
2 CONT          Alvise qu Zaccaria doctor cavalier is among the 2 proveditori di campo in terraferma on 20.12.1501 , see also Francesco Da Lezze
2 CONT          He is off. razon veteris on 12.05.1509
2 CONT          He is one of the defenders of Padua , list on 07.09.1509 , he defended the Saracinesca
2 CONT          He is proveditor biave on 16.05.1511
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1513
2 CONT          He goes in person to defend Padua with 2 sons , see 25.10.1513
2 CONT          He is elected podesta Justinopolis o Capodistria on 16.10.1513 , see Sanudo XVII
2 CONT          He is elected for Dieci novo on 09.12.1515 , see Sanudo XXI pagina 362
2 CONT          He is elected proveditor Treviso on 08.03.1516 and is replaced in the Dieci
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1517
2 CONT          He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1518
2 CONT          He is proveditor salis serving on
2 CONT          He is on zonta on 01.10.1520
2 CONT          He is on XL at election of Antonio Grimani on 29.06.1521
2 CONT          He is on XLI at election of Antonio Grimani on 04.07.1521
2 CONT          Alvise is capitano Bergamo on 16.12.1521
2 CONT          Alvise qu Zaccaria eques Procurator is proveditor salis on 17.12.1525
2 CONT          In zonta Senate on 30.09.1527
2 CONT          He is elected censor on 18.07.1528 , see Sanudo XLVIII pagina 272
2 CONT          He is backer of the Capello-bank on 07.09.1528
2 CONT          He is elected proveditor in Ravenna on 14.11.1528
2 CONT          He is proveditor in Ravenna anno 1529 , he is 75 years old then and asked to be replaced on 07.08.1529
2 CONT          He is elected luogotenente Friuli on 24.07.1530
2 CONT          He is elected consiglieri di Cannaregio on 18.08.1532
2 CONT
2 CONT          He + 21.04.1533 , buried in S. Francesco della Vigna ( Sanudo LVIII pagina 62 )  He is serving as consier Cannaregio , he died with " optima fama " , he was 79 years old
2 CONT
2 CONT         Barbaro x Trevisan anno 1486 ( Alvise di Zaccaria equitis et Procurator x Cassandra fu Andrea qu Marco della Tressa )
2 CONT
2 CONT        Offspring till the end of the Republic
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1474 : Girolamo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Lorenzo Loredan qu Pietro Procurator & Pietro Balbi qu Alvise )
2 CONT
2 CONT          No offspring
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.genmarenostrum.com/pagine-lettere/letterab/Barbaro/Barbaro3.html
2 CONT
2 CONT A1. N.H. Zaccaria (* Venezia 1422 + ivi 29-11-1492), Patrizio Veneto, 
2 CONT
2 CONT ambasciatore a Roma nel 1462 e 1480/1481, a Vienna nel II-1469, a Napoli IX-1471/3-9-1473, a Mantova 16-7-1476, a Ferrara nel 1479, a Cesena nel 1484, a Milano nel VII-1485,  Capitano di Verona nel 1476, inviato in Friuli a ispezi
2 CONC onare le fortificazioni nel 1477, Elettore del Doge nel 1478 e 1485, Correttore della promissione dogale nel 1485, Savio di Consiglio nel 1482, fu creato Conte Palatino da Papa Sisto IV, ma il titolo non fu portato dai discendenti
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT  = 1449 N.D. Chiara Vendramin Patrizia Veneta, figlia del Doge Andrea Vendramin
