2 CONT Vendramin x Giustiniani anno 1497 ( Luca fu Alvise fu il Principe x Paola di Benedetto )                Carta 207
2 CONT
2 CONT She + 20.05.1518 , moglie Luca Vendramin dal bancho , see Sanudo XXV pagina 419
2 CONT He + 02.04.1526 , he left 5 sons , he owned 20.000 ducats , he held a bank together with [https://www.geni.com/people/Antonio-Cappello-dal-Banco/6000000179797307844 Antonio ]& [https://www.geni.com/people/Silvano-Cappello-dal-Banc
2 CONC o/6000000179796106878 Silvano ]Capello      
2 CONT
2 CONT see Decima 1514 . San Angelo . 56  , his estimo is 244 ducats
2 CONT        x) 2 case in San Bartolomeo & botega in soler , rent is 80 ducats
2 CONT        x) la mita di un casa in San Donado in Murano , 22 ducats
2 CONT        x) livelo in San Jeremia in Canal Grande in casa di Sr. Zuan frisier , 8 ducats 12 solidi , shared with my brother Zuan
2 CONT        x) possession
2 CONT        x) on Zudecha in San Eufemia a botega & savonaria con sua magazine , for his part 12 ducats                             ( the Vendramin soap was famous for its high quality )
2 CONT        x) in Este al ponte de la restara certi . . . . molin da Cha Vendramin
2 CONT        x) in Rialto numerous botega's , undivided with my brother Giovanni
2 CONT        ----------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT         case : 112 ducats
2 CONT         possessions : 32 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT see Decima anno 1521 . San Angelo . 92 where his estimo is 549 ducats with income from his estates in Rovigo where he owns 676 campi
2 CONT      x) possessions in the villages of Pontechio & Frasinella , situated in Polesina de Rovigo , in all 676 campi
2 CONT      -----------------------------------------
2 CONT       possessions : 549 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT Anno 1528 the sons of the late Luca Vendramin disband the bank of their late father according to his will
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1518 : Alvise ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Girolamo Giustiniani qu Benedetto & Leonardo Venier di Moise )
2 CONT     1) Alvise entered Great Council on 20.08.1518 aged XX
2 CONT          He is candidate for sopracomito on 06.03.1520 , not elected with score of 45 / 152 votes
2 CONT          Alvise di Luca is among the guests of Doge Andrea Gritti on 21.05.1521 together with his father
2 CONT          Alvise di Luca is senator per ducati 400 on 20.12.1524
2 CONT          Alvise is on list at entry of cardinal Grimani on 08.03.1528
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1521 : Francesco di Luca qu Alvise qu il Principe ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Pietro Dona qu Nicolo & Benedetto Zorzi qu Girolamo equitis )
2 CONT     2) Francesco entered Great Council on 04.12.1523 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         Francesco is on list at entry of cardinal Grimanu on 08.03.1528
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Marco born on 24.08.1510
2 CONT     3) Marco qu Luca qu Alvise qu il Serenissimo entered Great Council on 02.09.1530 aged XX
2 CONT         Marco qu Luca is also convicted in the killing of a notary , banned for 3 years and must pay the sum of 300 ducats at the widow and children of the deceased  ( Sanudo LV pagina 29 )
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Giovanni
2 CONT     4) Giovanni qu Luca qu Alvise qu il Princeps entered Great Council on 04.12.1537 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Andrea
2 CONT     5) Andrea qu Luca qu Alvise entered Great Council on 21.06.1538 aged XXV
2 CONT         Andrea qu Luca al bancho was banned for life on 07.10.1531 for killing a notary ( Sanudo LV pagina 29 )
2 CONT         He is member of the compagnia ' Cortesi ' on 27.02.1533 ( Sanudo LVII pagina
2 CONT
