2 CONT
2 CONT         Grimani x Foscari anno 08.06.1517 ( Marco di Girolamo di Antonio Procurator x Bianca di Francesco cavalier Procurator qu Alvise )    In Santa Maria Zubenigo , see Sanudo XXIV pagina 339
2 CONT
2 CONT         Marco qu Girolamo became Procurator San Marco on 30.03.1522 per 20.000 ducati  , the new Procurator is 28 years old  
2 CONT
2 CONT        He became patriarch Aquileia anno 1529 after he renounced the Procuratia , this after his brother Marino renounced the Patriarchate , see Sanudo L pagina 170
2 CONT
2 CONT         Bianca Foscari + 07.12.1526 , see Sanudo XLIII . 397 , see is buried in San Giobbe in the arch of her father
2 CONT
2 CONT         He left a daughter , Elena
2 CONT
2 CONT                Foscari x Grimani anno 1534 ( Pietro di Marco x Elena di Marco Patriarca di Aquileia )
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Marco, grandchild of Doge Antonio Grimani and brother of Vettor Grimani, was elected in 1522 as Procurator.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1529 he was appointed patriarch "elected" of Aquileia, but his authority remained very limited because his brother Marino Grimani reserved the title of patriarch, with right of regression, and the exercise of patriarchal functi
2 CONC ons, including the collation of ecclesiastical benefits.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was papal legate in Scotland between 1543 and 1544. https://www.jstor.org/stable/24409405?seq=1#page_scan_tab_contents
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1537 he was appointed Admiral of the pontifical portion of the fleet of the Holy League organized by Pope Paul III together with Venice, the Emperor Charles V and the Knights of Malta in anti-Ottoman function. With this qualifi
2 CONC cation he took part in the Battle of Prevesa.
2 CONT
