2 CONT Contarini x Contarini anno 1479 ( Pietro fu Giacomo fu Cristoforo  x Contarina di Nicolo qu Andrea )        Contrada San Samuele                 Carta 461
2 CONT
2 CONT Pietro Contarini qu Giacomo is capitano galleys Beirut anno 1496 , he is nicknamed ' Rosso ' , see Sanudo II
2 CONT
2 CONT See also Sanudo IX. 34 for Giacomo Contarini qu Pietro rosso who owns a house in Poluello
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1504 : Giacomo qu Pietro ( sponsors are Helena Contarini uxor Sebastiano Morosini qu Francesco & Paola Contarini uxor Giovanni Bragadin qu Andrea , tt. are Giovanni Bragadin qu Andrea * & Benedetto Dolfin qu Daniele )
2 CONT     1) Giacomo qu Pietro qu Giacomo entered Great Council on 27.11.1509 aged XXV
2 CONT          He is nominated at election on 27.01.1526
2 CONT
2 CONT          Decima 1514 . San Samuele . 17 .  Giacomo qu Pietro qu Giacomo qu Cristoforo  - this is correct , red. - , estimo of 254 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT          He is at election on 27.01.1526 for cotimo di Londra , not in ballot
2 CONT          He is a relative of cardinal Corner , see Sanudo 48.48 anno 1528
2 CONT          He owns the villa in Poluello , see decima San Samuele . 17
2 CONT
2 CONT                      Contarini x Corner anno 1505 ( Giacomo fu Pietro x Lugrezia di Giorgio Cavalier Procurator qu Marco )
2 CONT
2 CONT                      From this marriage 2 sons
2 CONT
