1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://cardinaliserenissima.uniud.it/55-pisani-albero.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT Pisani, ramo  'dal Banco' 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/BO/B.O.IV.P.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Pisani x Giustiniani anno 1493 (  * Alvise fu Giovanni x Cecilia di Benedetto )        Carta 123              
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . Santa Maria Zubenigo . 55 . Estimo of 684 ducats *
2 CONT
2 CONT * His casa stazio in Santa Maria Zubenigo is estimated at 90 ducats .
2 CONT    His casa stazio in San Vidal at 45 ducats rented to Giovanni Battista Morosini
2 CONT
2 CONT * This is Alvise Pisani banker .
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Napels on 30.06.1528 . See Sanudo XLVIII
2 CONT
2 CONT He was elected Procurator di San Marco on 18.05.1516 , he promised 10.000 ducats , he was 48 years at his election
2 CONT The day earlier his daughter married Giovanni Corner di Giorgio cavalier e Procurator with a dowry of 10.000 ducats . See Sanudo XXII . 223
2 CONT
2 CONT For the marriages of the daughters of Alvise Pisani see Sanudo XXXVI pagina 410
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Giovanni
2 CONT    1) Giovanni di Alvise enters Great Council on 11.12.1514 per ducati but the prove di eta mentions only the entry of his brother Francesco
2 CONT        Giovanni di Alvise is member of the Immortali on 11.02.1519
2 CONT        Giovanni  was on the XLV in the election of Andrea Gritti anno 1523 . Giovanni would liquidate the bank of his father
2 CONT        Giovanni di Alvise is elected podesta Verona on 13.12.1526 per ducati 2000 , é di pregadi
2 CONT        Giovanni qu Alvise became Procurator San Marco , elected on 28.05.1528 for 14.000 ducats , see Sanudo XLVII
2 CONT        He would enter as Procurator anno 1532 but after the death of his father he intends to enter as Procurator on 01.03.1529
2 CONT        He shuts down the Pisani-bank on 03.12.1528
2 CONT        He is elected ambassador to France on 16.07.1530 , see Sanudo LIII
2 CONT        He is proveditor biave on 24.09.1533
2 CONT
2 CONT        Pisani x Gritti on 17.01.1520 ( Giovanni di Alvise x Benedetta fu Francesco di Andrea Procurator )
2 CONT
2 CONT        Their son Andrea is great-grandson of Doge , see Sanudo LVI pagina 96
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1514 : Francesco di Alvise qu Giovanni ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giacomo Contarini qu Battista & Francesco Marcello qu Andrea )
2 CONT     2) Francesco entered Great Council on 10.11.1514 aged XVIII
2 CONT         He became cardinal in 1517 !
2 CONT         He became bishop of Padua anno 1524
2 CONT         He + anno 1570 in Rome
2 CONT
2 CONT         His natural daughter married Tommaso Mocenigo
2 CONT
2 CONT        Mocenigo x Pisani anno 1530 ( Tommaso fu Alvise x Giulia di Francesco Cardinale )  see Sanudo LIV , the dota was 10.000 ducats !            She would 2x Francesco Foscarini
2 CONT
2 CONT Capello x Pisani anno 1524 ( Giovanni fu Lorenzo x Paola di Alvise )       Wedding in Ca Pisani on 18.06.1524 , the dota is 8000 ducats , she is last daughter of Alvise Pisani who gets married
2 CONT Corner x Pisani anno 06.10.1516 ( Giovanni di Giorgio x Andrianna di Alvise )
2 CONT Grimani x Pisani on 10.02.1522 ( Antonio di Vincenzo qu il Serenissimo  x Elisabetta di Alvise ) 
2 CONT Priuli x Pisani ( Antonio dal banco qu Marco x donna di Alvise )
2 CONT Priuli x Pisani on 03.03.1511 ( Vincenzo di Lorenzo x Maria di Alvise Procurator qu Giovanni qu Ermolao )
2 CONT
2 CONT On these 5 marriages the total of the doti is 40.000 ducats
