2 CONT https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/BO/B.O.III.S.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Trevisan x Marcello anno 1473 ( * Domenico miles fu Zaccaria fu Febo x Suardamor di Pietro )     carta 123
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Marco . 21 , estimo of 72 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT Domenico Trevisan becomes Procurator di San Marco on 04.08.1503
2 CONT He is elected capitano general da mar anno 1522
2 CONT He was buried in San Giovanni Paolo
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1492 : Marco Antonio ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giovanni Donà qu Bartolommeo & Bernardo Boldu di Filippo )                                     - future Doge -
2 CONT     1) Marcantonio di Domenico eques qu Zaccaria entered Great Council on 05.09.1494 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         Marco Antonio di Domenico is extraordinario on 03.10.1499
2 CONT         He joins his father on mission to the Soldan of Egypt on 22.01.1511
2 CONT         Marco Antonio di Domenico eques Procurator  nominated Marin Sanudo at election for censor on 12.09.1518
2 CONT         He is elected in the Senate on 22.09.1522
2 CONT         He is consiglieri Cyprus on 24.08.1524 , é di Pregadi
2 CONT         He is senator on 01.10.1524
2 CONT         Elected among 5 savi for island of Nanfo on 04.02.1529 , fo al luogo di procurator
2 CONT         He is luogotenente Cyprus on 18.03.1531
2 CONT
2 CONT         Elected Doge anno 1553
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1495 : Pietro di Domenico eques qu Zaccaria qu Febo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Michele Trevisan qu Andrea & Alessandro Contarini qu Alvise )
2 CONT anno 1498 : Pietro di Domenico equitis qu Zaccaria  ( sponsor is the mother , the father is orator in Hispania , tt. are Gabriele Morosini qu Francesco & Michele Trevisan qu Andrea )
2 CONT
2 CONT     2) Pietro is one of the defenders of Padua on 09.09.1509 , he is on guard at the piazza
2 CONT         He joins his father at Chioggia to go to Papal court on 10.10.1510
2 CONT         He joins his father who meets the French king in Milano on 07.11.1515
2 CONT         Pietro di Domenico Procurator is elected proveditor sopra cotimo Alexandria on 03.09.1519
2 CONT         He is savio sopra mercandantia on 02.10.1520
2 CONT         Pietro di Domenico cavalier Procurator is on election for senator per ducati on 29.08.1526 , not elected
2 CONT
2 CONT         Pietro married a daughter of Giorgio Corner Procurator , see Sanudo XXIII . 362 , he was present at the funeral of his father-in-law
2 CONT         He was ill at reception of his brother-in-law cardinal Corner
2 CONT
2 CONT        He + 13.11.1532 , no offspring , he died from ' colico '  , his father is serving savio del consiglio
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1501 : Girolamo di Domenico equitis qu Zaccaria ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giovanni Trevisan qu Zaccaria eques & Michele Trevisan qu Andrea qu Febo )
2 CONT      3) Girolamo is at election on post for proveditor sopra le camere on 19.10.1516
2 CONT           He is nominated for sopragastaldo on 14.09.1522
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1506 : Alvise di Domenico equitis Procurator qu Zaccaria ( sponsor is the father now Procurator de San Marco , tt. are Michele Trevisan qu Andrea & Castellano Boldu qu Castellano )
2 CONT     4) Alvise entered Great Council on 04.12.1510 after the Barbarella
2 CONT          He is judex forinsecori on 23.12.1511
2 CONT          He is on XL civilis on 29.05.1516 , elected on 25.03.1516 per ducati 200
2 CONT          Alvise di Domenico cavalier Procurator is elected proveditor Cividale di Friuli on 23.07.1517
2 CONT          He is member of the compagnia named Zardinieri , see 16.02.1519
2 CONT          He is at XL civilis novissimo on 23.05.1522
2 CONT          He is castellano Brescia on 01.06.1523   
2 CONT          He is elected podesta & capitano Belluno on 17.02.1526 per ducati 300
2 CONT          He is podesta & capitano Belluno on 11.07.1528
2 CONT          He leaves for Belluno on 06.02.1529 , he is in mourning because of the death of his brother
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1511 : Vincenzo di Domenico eques Procurator qu Zaccaria  ( sponsor is the father Procurator eques , tt. are Girolamo Loredan qu Domenico & Federico Morosini qu Girolamo )
2 CONT     5) Vincenzo entered Great Council on 05.12.1511 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT no probation : Francesco
2 CONT     6) Francesco entered Great Council on 17.08.1512 aged XXV , tt. are Domenico Onoradi qu Francesco & Alvise Dolfin qu Girolamo who testify he is legitimate son of Domenico & Suordamor Marcello
2 CONT         Francesco di Domenico cavalier Procurator is at election on 28.02.1517
2 CONT
2 CONT        No offspring of this branch
