2 CONT anno 1485 : Angelo qu Nicolo qu Daniele  ( sponsored by his mother who is a widow , tt. are Ermolao Minio qu Lorenzo & Angelo Contarini qu Nicolo )       
2 CONT     1) Angelo entered Great Council on 30.04.1490 aged XXV
2 CONT          He is in villa in Bovalenta on 07.06.1509 , will return to Venice
