2 CONT     2) Giovanni is podesta Monselice on 30.07.1498 
2 CONT          Giovanni is in Asolo on 07.06.1509 , will return to Venice  
2 CONT          Giovanni qu Nicolo helped to escape his relative Alvise Soranzo qu Vettore from prison on 21.01.1510
2 CONT          He is banished for 10 years to¨Padua on 13.02.1510 , punishment for helping to escape from prison Alvise Soranzo qu Vettore
2 CONT          He gets a gratia on 29.07.1511
2 CONT          He is at election for proveditor general in Dalmatia on 21.03.1523 , his score is 75 / 120 votes
2 CONT          He is at election for proveditor Ravenna on 06.07.1527 , his score is very bad with 27 / 186 votes
2 CONT          Giovanni is a relative of Cardinal Corner anno 1528 , see Sanudo 48 . 48                                                                                                                                                   
2 CONT
