1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://www.treccani.it/enciclopedia/bernardo-giustinian_(Dizionario-Biografico)/ ...Sposò nel 1433 Elisabetta di Giovanni Priuli, dalla quale ebbe sette figli, quattro maschi (Leonardo, Lorenzo, Giovanni e Marco) 
2 CONC e tre femmine (una delle quali, Orsa, sposò Andrea Dandolo e fu madre dell'umanista Marco).  
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.giustiniani.info/giustinian.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT  H1. N.H. Bernardo (* 6-1-1408 + 11-3-1489), Patrizio Veneto, 
2 CONT
2 CONT nel Maggior Consiglio dal 1427, ambasciatore a Napoli nel 1459 e in Francia nel 1461 (armato Cavaliere dal Re di Francia), ambasciatore a Roma nel 1462, 1465 e 1471, Capitano di Padova nel 1467, Provveditore di terraferma nel 1468
2 CONC , Procuratotre di San Marco il 17-12-1474, Elettore del Doge per 5 volte 1473/1486, Deputato alle fortificazioni del Friuli nel 1475; scrittore ed erudito.               
2 CONT
2 CONT  = 1432 N.D. Isabella, figlia del N.H. Giovanni Priuli, Patrizio Veneto
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.rikvanhauwe.be/Venice/Procuratori.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT 92 Giustiniani , Bernardo cavalier qu Leonardo Procurator , on 18.12.1474 , instead of Pietro Mocenigo elected as Doge , 14 years 2 months , succeeded by Giovanni Contarini qu Agostino
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1431 : Bernardo di Leonardo qu Bernardo( sponsor is the father , tt. are Giacomo Zane di Giovanni & Marino Soranzo quNicolo )  
2 CONT
2 CONT         He is the famous orator - historian and eventually Procurator di San Marco
2 CONT
2 CONT     1) Bernardo di Leonardo is avogador curia petition and entered Great Council on 22.09.1433 as avogador piccoli , his father testifies
2 CONT         Bernardo di Leonardo is savio ai ordine on 14.10.1441
2 CONT         Bernardo qu Leonardo is in zonta Senate on 30.09.1448
2 CONT         He is senator on 09.09.1453
2 CONT         Bernardo qu Leonardo is present at entry of his son after Barbarella anno 1456
2 CONT         Bernardo qu Leonardo Procurator  is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1456
2 CONT         Bernardo qu Leonardo Pr. is savio terraferma on 01.04.1458
2 CONT         Bernardo qu Leonardo Procurator is savio terraferma on 01.07.1460
2 CONT         Bernardo miles is consigliere ducale on 14.02.1468
2 CONT         He is savio consiglio on 11.04.1472
2 CONT         He is consigliere ducale on 09.12.1472
2 CONT         Bernardo miles is elected on the XL at election of Doge Marcello on 03.08.1473
2 CONT         Bernardo miles is elected on the XXV at election of Doge Marcello on 05.08.1473
2 CONT         He is on XLI at election of Doge Marcello on 13.08.1473
2 CONT         He is on the XL at election of Doge Pietro Mocenigo on 06.12.1474
2 CONT         He is in XLI at election of Doge Pietro Mocenigo on 11.12.1474
2 CONT         He is Procurator San Marco on 18.12.1474 , instead of Pietro Mocenigo elected as Doge , for 14 years 2 months , succeeded by Giovanni Contarini qu Agostino
2 CONT            He is on the XL at election of Doge Vendramin on 28.02.1475
2 CONT            He is on the XXV at election of Doge Vendramin on 28.02.1475
2 CONT            He is on XLI at election of Doge Vendramin on 02.03.1476
2 CONT            He is savio consiglio on 01.04.1477
2 CONT            He is savio consiglio on 01.04.1478
2 CONT            He is on the XL at election of Doge Giovanni Mocenigo on 12.05.1478
2 CONT            He is on the XXV at election of Doge Giovanni Mocenigo on 12.05.1478
2 CONT            He is on the XLI at election of Doge Giovanni Mocenigo on 13.05.1478
2 CONT         He is serving savio consiglio on 01.03.1481
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + anno 1489
2 CONT
