2 CONC  & Lorenzo Giustiniani di Bernardo Procurator )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1480: Alvise qu Marco di Bernardo Procurator ( sponsor idem supra , tt; are Filippo Pasqualigo qu Pietro & a notary )
2 CONT      Alvise qu Marco di Bernardo Procurator entered Great Council on 05.12.1482 after the Barbarella
2 CONT      He is savio ai ordine on 10.09.1485
2 CONT      He is savio ai ordine on 01.10.1486
2 CONT      He is off. tabula introitus on 21.07.1500
2 CONT      He is senator on 02.09.1509
2 CONT      He is grain merchant with his brothers on 31.05.1510 , see Sanudo X . 469
2 CONT
