2 CONT
2 CONT      Giustiniani x Pesaro anno 1489 ( Alvise fu Marco fu Bernardo Procurator x Andriana di Girolamo )   * Sanudo calls him nepote dil zeneral novo
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1485 : Pietro ( sponsors are Lorenzo Giustiniani di Bernardo Procurator & Alvise Giustinian qu Marco  , tt. are Antonio Contarini qu Francesco & the sponsor Lorenzo Giustiniani )                                  
2 CONT      Pietro entered Great Council on 04.12.1487 after the Barbarella
2 CONT      Pietro qu Marco is savio ai ordine on 01.04.1490
2 CONT      He is savio ai ordine on 01.10.1490
2 CONT      He is savio ai ordine on 01.10.1492
2 CONT      Pietro qu Marco qu Bernardo Procurator is auditor veteris on 20.12.1496 , he was at balla d'oro on 26.03.1485
2 CONT      He is savio ai ordine on 01.10.1501
2 CONT      He is camerlengo di comun on 20.07.1508
2 CONT      He is off. razon veteris , on 05.03.1510 , fo camerlengo di comun on 20.07.1508
2 CONT      He is a sort of official guide for the Turkish ambassador at his visit to Venice in january 1513
2 CONT
2 CONT      When he was camerlengo di comun anno 1509 he stole 4900 ducats , see Sanudo XXIII . 216 , he became a fugitive and was staying in Bologna anno novembris 1516
