2 CONT       Decima 1514 . San Fantin . 18 . Possession of 18 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT      He + 11.08.1518 in exile in Rome , the Venetian ambassador was present at his funeral , he lived in Rome in the house of Domino Girolamo Lippomano , see Sanudo XXV pagina 585
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1492 : Nicolo ( presented by Pietro & Alvise fratres qu Marco di Bernardo Procurator , tt. are probably the sponsors )
2 CONT      Nicolo qu Marco qu Bernardo Procurator is in Constantinopel , see 03.11.1498 in Sanudo II . 120
2 CONT      Nicolo is in Constantinopel , see Sanudo IX. 261 in a letter to his brothers Alvise & Pietro , see 18.10.1509 , this about a great earthquake in Constantinopel
2 CONT      He is appointed substitute bailo Constantinopel as Andrea Foscolo wants to return to Venice , see Sanudo X on 31.05.1510
2 CONT      Nicolo qu Marco qu Bernardo is the most important Venetian merchant in Constantinopel , see Sanudo XXVII pagina 594 , he returns to Venice on 31.08.1519
2 CONT
2 CONT       Nicolo + 12.12.1519 , he had stayed 22 years in Constantinopel as merchant and bailo
