2 CONT Giustiniani x Contarini anno 1475 ( Lorenzo di Bernardo equitis Procurator x Elena di Girolamo qu Stefano )     Carta 454                          
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Moise . 6 . His estimo is 567 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorenzo is returning luogotenente Cypri on 02.09.1510 , Sanudo says he has 7 sons and 3 married daughters
2 CONT
2 CONT Lorenzo + on 10.09.1514 aged 76 , before his death he had entered a scuola , see Sanudo about this
2 CONT
2 CONT He is lying in state in San Moise
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1502 : Leonardo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Pietro Giustiniani qu Nicolo & Michele Priuli di Costantino & Girolamo Corner qu Fantin )
2 CONT     1) Leonardo is elected senator pro ducati on 28.08.1515 , he loaned 1000 ducats
2 CONT         Leonardo is gobernator introitus on 20.03.1517  - he was at Balla d'Oro on 18.10.1502 - , he was elected at 06.08.1516 for the formidable sum of 3000 ducats
2 CONT         He is at election for zonta Senate on 30.09.1518 , not elected with 338 / 617 votes
2 CONT         He enters zonta Senate on 22.11.1523
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1525
2 CONT         He is senator on 19.08.1526
2 CONT         He is senator elected on 01.09.1527
2 CONT         He is senator on 01.10.1528 , see imprestidi on 30.12.1528
2 CONT         He is capitano Verona on 13.09.1531 ,  when he carries the spada his compagno is Andrea De Molin qu Marino who got probation in 1506
2 CONT
2 CONT         Giustiniani x Zane anno 1516 ( Leonardo fu Lorenzo x Elisabetta fu Girolamo vidua 1° Bartolommeo Pisani , 2° Vincenzo Balbi )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1503 : Bernardo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Alvise Muazzo qu Pietro & Carolo Valier qu Girolamo )
2 CONT      2) Bernardo was murdered in the night of 06.07.1515 , his body was found in Campo Rusolo ( o San Gallo which is the name of the church ) . His body was laid to rest in San Moise . See Sanudo XX . 368 a.o.
2 CONT          The deceased was a merchant in a.o. Puglia , he was not married .
2 CONT
2 CONT          He was killed at 03.00 a.m. by Angelo Bragadin qu Pietro de Campo Rusola who was in the company of Pietro Dandolo qu Alvise and pre Ettore Zon who where there with a ( married ) maid of Nicolo Aurelio secretary of the X
2 CONT          The lady in question was in love with Angelo Bragadin
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1506 : Marco ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Pietro Pesaro qu Nicolo & Francesco Pesaro qu Bernardo )
2 CONT      3)  Marco is among candidates for sopracomito on 01.02.1519
2 CONT           Marco qu Lorenzo is on list of debitors on 18.08.1528
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1509 : Giustiniano ( sponsors are Giacomo Soranzo qu Francesco & Leonardo Giustiniani di Lorenzo qu Bernardo equitis , tt. are Girolamo Lippomano qu Tommaso & Alvise Giustiniani qu Marco qu Bernardo equitis Procurator )
2 CONT     4) Giustiniano di Lorenzo qu Bernardo eques Procurator entered Great Council on 05.12.1511 after the Barbarella
2 CONT          He enters as Knight of Rhodos on 05.10.1530 and no longer is in libro nobilium on 05.10.1530 , he has income of 400 ducats a year
2 CONT
2 CONT          He was a knight of Rhodos , see Sanudo LIV . 15 on 05.10.1535 , he is than no longer a Venetian noble
2 CONT ,
2 CONT anno 1510 : Girolamo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Paolo Nani qu Giacomo & Vettore Lippomano qui Tommaso )
2 CONT     5) Girolamo di Lorenzo entered Great Council on 04.12.1510 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1517 : Giovanni ( sponsor is the mother - widow , tt. are Leonardo Giustiniani his elder brother & Tommaso Tiepolo qu Francesco )
2 CONT     6) Giovanni entered Great Council on 04.12.1519 after the Barbarella
2 CONT         Giovanni qu Lorenzo  is among the young nobles who made fun of Marin Grimani qu Pietro on 09.02.1520
2 CONT         He is sopracomito per ducati on 24.01.1525
2 CONT         He is sopracomito in Armada of the bastardella , left Venice on 14.03.1528
2 CONT         He is in Armada with galley from 14.03.1529 , see status on 30.06.1532
2 CONT         He returned with his galley to Venice on 22.12.1532
2 CONT         He is patronus Arsenale on 17.12.1535
2 CONT
2 CONT         Giustiniani x Pisani anno 1537 ( Giovanni fu Lorenzo x Marina fu Vettore )
2 CONT
2 CONT anno 1518 : Benedetto ( sponsor is the mother - widow , tt. are Barbon Morosini di Giustiniano & Giovanni Giacomo Foscari qu Antonio )
2 CONT     7) Benedetto entered Great Council on 04.12.1519 after the Barbarella
2 CONT
2 CONT Also :  Morosini x Giustiniani anno 1505 ( Barbon di Giustiniano qu Marco x Elisabetta di Lorenzo ) 
2 CONT Also : Soranzo x Giustiniani anno 1491 ( Giacomo fu Francesco fu Giovanni a bancho x Francesca di Lorenzo qu Bernardo Procurator )
2 CONT Also : Lippomano x Giustiniani anno 1496 ( Vettore qu Tommaso a bancho x donna di Lorenzo qu Bernardo cavalier Procurator )
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://www.giustiniani.info/giustinian.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT  I3. N.H. Leonardo (* 1442 + 1514), 
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrizio Veneto, Podestà e Capitano di Ravenna nel 1498, Savio di terraferma, dei X Savi nel 1499, Podestà di Brescia nel 1500, ambasciatore in Francia nel 1501, Avogadore di Comun nel 1502, Governatore delle pubbliche entrate nel
2 CONC  1503, Consigliere di città per ils estiere di Santa Croce nel 1506, Luogotenente Generale del Regno di Cipro nel 1507.
2 CONT
2 CONT   = 1474 N.D. Eleonora, figlia del N.H. Girolamo Contarini, Patrizio Veneto 
