2 CONT anno 1463 : Pietro di Giovanni qu Giorgio ( sponsor is the father , tt are Giovanni Lando qu Marino & Andrea Zane u Giovanni )                                                                  
2 CONT     1) Pietro entered Great Council on 14.01.1466 after the Barbarella , he became podesta Vicenza on 24.09.1496
2 CONT         He is XL criminalis on 28.03.1475
2 CONT         He is on XLV at election of Doge Vendramin on 29.02.1475
2 CONT         He is in Senate on 16.08.1492
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 27.10.1493
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 29.09.1494
2 CONT         He is senator on 27.09.1495
2 CONT         He is podesta Vicenza on 24.09.1496 , he was at balla d'oro on 10.11.1463
2 CONT         He is elected on 10 savi a tansar on 15.10.1500
2 CONT         He is avogador di comun on 13.05.1501 , see Sanudo IV . 49
2 CONT         He is elected luogotenente Cypri on 20.06.1501 , he refused as the job is too dangerous
2 CONT         He is podesta Brescia on 24.05.1501 , see Sanudo IV. 49
2 CONT         He is capo Dieci on 01.02.1503
2 CONT         He is capo Dieci on 01.11.1505
2 CONT         He is luogotenente Friuli on 08.03.1506 , see Sanudo VI . 308
2 CONT         Pietro Capello is capo X on 01.10.1507
2 CONT         He is consigliere ducale on 09.01.1507
2 CONT         He is on X savi on 06.02.1508
2 CONT         He is proveditor sopra danari di la guerra , on 02.04.1509
2 CONT         He is on zonta Senate on 01.10.1509
2 CONT         He is at election for proveditor general di mar on 27.12.1509 , is savio del consiglio
2 CONT         He is in Dieci on 18.08.1510
2 CONT         He is capo Dieci on 01.01.1510
2 CONT         He is proveditor sopra i danari di guerra elected on 04.11.1512
2 CONT         He is consiglieri ducale on 07.05.1514 for sestieri Cannaregio as substitue for Alvise Emo
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1516
2 CONT         He is in zonta Senate on 01.10.1517
2 CONT         He is savio del consiglio on 01.01.1517
2 CONT         He is elected cassier on 07.03.1517 amidst fierce competition
2 CONT         He is savio del consiglio on 04.01.1518 , fo savio del consiglio
2 CONT         He is proveditor sopra l'armar on 14.03.1519 but he refused
2 CONT         He is censor on 23.09.1520 , see Sanudo XXIX pagina 200
2 CONT         He is consiglieri ducale Cannaregio on 01.06.1521
2 CONT         He was on the XL in election of Antonio Grimani anno 1521 .        
2 CONT         Pietro is on the XLI in election of Andrea Gritti anno 1523 , he is listed as supporter of Gritti      
2 CONT         He is savio consiglio on 01.10.1523
2 CONT
2 CONT         Capello x Vendramin ( Pietro di Giovanni  x donna di Bartolommeo qu il Serenissimo )          
2 CONT
2 CONT         Pietro Capello qu Giovanni rents casa stazio in San Felice from Pietro & Giacomo Trevisan dalla tressa , see Decima San Vidal
2 CONT
2 CONT         He + 02.03.1524
2 CONT
