2 CONT anno 1472 : Lorenzo ( sponsor is the father , tt. are Nicolo Mocenigo qu Leonardo Procurator & Pietro Lando di Domino Girolamo archidec. Cretensis)   
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Angelo 49 - 50 for Pietro & Lorenzo . Estimo of 87 ducats , see Pietro
2 CONT
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Angelo 49 -50  for Lorenzo .  Estimo of 34 ducats  .
2 CONT Decima 1514 . San Angelo . 88 . Possession of 41 ducats
2 CONT
2 CONT     3) Lorenzo entered Great Council on 20.01.1480 aged XXV , his father & Giovanni Giacomo di Michaelis testify
2 CONT         He is XL criminalis on 18.04.1485
2 CONT         He is ad camera imprestiti on 12.04.1496 , he was ad balla d'oro on 10.11.1472
2 CONT         Lorenzo is brother-in-law of Girolamo Grimani di Antonio Procurator and is thus considered a relative of Ca Grimani ( both married a daughter of Francesco Priuli )
