2 CONT **B5. [2m., parentage uncertain] Borisz Conrad, *in Kiev ca 1112, +1154/55, a contestant for the throne on his brothers death; m.Anna, dau.of Constantine Dukas
2 CONT ***C1. '''Koloman/Constantinos Calamanos, Regent of Cilicia (1163-75)''', settled in Kilikia and left descendants there
