2 CONT
2 CONT Ladislas I 'the Saint' Arpád, King of Hungary was the son of Béla I Arpád, King of Hungary.1 He married Adelheid von Zähringen, daughter of Berchtold I Herzog von Zähringen. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1095. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ladislas I 'the Saint' Arpád, King of Hungary succeeded to the title of King Ladislas I of Hungary in 1077. (1)
2 CONT
