1 NOTE He reigned from 1077 to 1095. He deposed Salomon, but had to deal with him again when he invaded the country with Cuman forces. Ladislas acquired Croatia for Hungary and christianized it. He also introduced a legal code in his enl
2 CONC arged kingdom. He died while preparing to go on the Frist Crusade. He was canonized. His relics were enshrined in the cathedral he founded in Nagyvarad.
