2 CONT Golem (Greek: Goulamos,[1] Albanian: Gulam) was an Albanian lord and vassal of Kruja and Elbasan in circa 1254.[2] He married the daughter of sebastos Gregorios Kamonas and Komnena Nemanjić and was thus entitled the rule of his fa
2 CONC ther-in-law.[2] He was the last prince of Principality of Arbër.
