2 CONT Betrothed (Feb 1194) to LEOPOLD of Austria, son of LEOPOLD V Duke of Austria & his wife Ilona of Hungary ([1176/77]-San Germano 28 Jul 1230, bur Lilienfeld).  This betrothal was agreed as part of the terms for the release of Richa
2 CONC rd I King of England from the custody of Emperor Heinrich VI King of Germany in Feb 1194[45].  He later succeeded as LEOPOLD VI Duke of Austria.
