2 CONT engaged in a long struggle with Hildebrand (Pope Gregory VII) on the question of lay investiture (seeInvestiture Controversy), eventually drawing excommunication on himself and doing penance at Canossa (1077). His lastyears were s
2 CONC pent countering the rebellion of his sons Conrad and Henry (the future Henry V
