2 CONT
2 CONT      Adalbert Babenberg was born in 1107. (1) He was the son of Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich and Agnes Salian. (1) He married Adelheid of Poland, daughter of Boleslaw III, Duke of Poland, before 1132. (1) He mar
2 CONC ried Hedwig Arpád, daughter of Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia, in 1132. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1137. (1)
2 CONT
