2 CONC e.[1] Initially it appeared that Władysław would regain power over Poland very soon. The expedition against the Junior Dukes was launched in 1146, but due to flooding of the Oder River and the pressures on the German king by Alber
2 CONC t the Bear and Conrad of Meissen the campaign finally failed.
