2 CONT
2 CONT Vladislav I, King of Bohemia (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #113916, d. 1174
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Jul 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Vladislav I, King of Bohemia was the son of Vladislav I, Duke of Bohemia and Rixa von Berg. (1) He married, firstly, Gertrud Babenberg, daughter of Leopold III 'the Saint' Markgraf von Österreich and Agnes Salian, in 1140. (1
2 CONC ) He married, secondly, Judith von Thuringe, daughter of Ludwig I Landgraf von Thuringe, in 1153. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1174. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Vladislav I, King of Bohemia was a member of the House of Premysl. (2) He succeeded to the title of Duke Vladislav II of Bohemia in 1140. (1) He was created King Vladislav I of Bohemia in 1158. (1) He abdicated as King of Boh
2 CONC emia in 1172. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Vladislav I, King of Bohemia and Gertrud Babenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Adalbert of Bohemia d. 1200 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Svatopluk of Bohemia d. a 1169 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Friedrich, King of Bohemia+ d. 1189 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Vladislav I, King of Bohemia and Judith von Thuringe
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Rixa of Bohemia+ d. 1282 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Premysl Ottokar I, King of Bohemia+ b. c 1155, d. 15 Dec 1230 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Vladislav III Heinrich, Duke of Bohemia b. c 1160, d. 1222 (1)
