2 CONT F, #114049, b. 1154, d. 1182
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=19 Aug 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Agnes Babenberg was born in 1154. ▼1 She was the daughter of Heinrich II Jasomirgott Herzog von Österreich and Theodora Comnene. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary, son of Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary and Euphrosine of Novgorod, in 1167. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hermann, Duke of Croatia. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1182. ▼1
2 CONT *Citations ▼1.[S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 77. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession. S
2 CONC ource / Forrás:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p11405.htm#i114049
