1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clementia_van_Bourgondië
2 CONT Clemence de Bourgogne born about 1078 died about 1133
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 
2 CONT #Robert de Flandres
2 CONT #Godefroi V Duke of Lower Lotharingia
2 CONT
2 CONT Clemence and Robert de Flandres had three children: 
2 CONT #Baldwin VII, Comte de Flandre 
2 CONT #William de Flandre 
2 CONT #Philip de Flandre
2 CONT
2 CONT Clemence de Bourgogne was the daughter of Guillaume de Bourgogne and Etiennette]
2 CONT
2 CONT Clemence de Bourgogne was appointed regent in Flanders during the absence of her first husband on crusade.  She promoted the monastic movement and introduced Cluniac rule into several abbeys in Flanders.  She founded Bourbourg Abb
2 CONC ey with her first husband in 1103.  She opposed the succession in 1119 of Count Charles, supporting the candidature of Guillaume d'Ypres. 
2 CONT
