2 CONT '''Roger III''' (1118 – 2 or 12 May 1148) was the eldest son of King Roger II of Sicily and Elvira of Castile.[1] He was the Duke of Apulia from 1134 until his death. .. ... 
2 CONT ------
2 CONT *https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/GLPZ-7Q5
