2 CONT
2 CONT Donald Matthew, The Norman Kingdom of Sicily, ISBN 0-521-26911-3
2 CONT
2 CONT John Julius Norwich, The Kingdom in the Sun, reprinted as part of his The Normans in Sicily, ISBN 0-14-015212-1
2 CONT
2 CONT Costanza, sacred opera performance at Our Lady of Mt. Carmel Church, Bronx, NY on 26 October 2008. John Marino, distinguished composer conductor, arranger, pianist, coordinated the performance. The libretto was written by Florence
2 CONC  Bocarius.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Taylor Simeti Travels with a Medieval Queen, 2001, ISBN 978-0374278786
