2 CONT
2 CONT She became a mistress of Bohemian king Ottokar II of Bohemia. She had three children with him:
2 CONT
2 CONT Nicholas I, Duke of Troppau 
2 CONT Agnes 
2 CONT Elisabeth 
2 CONT unknown daughter - wife of Vok of Kravar. 
2 CONT In 1261 she return to Austria with her queen.
