2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/8113/henry_i-de_brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke of Brabant. Reigning from 1190 to 1235, he was the 2nd Duke of Brabant and is said to have "assumed the title." He was also known as "le Guerroyeur," "the Pious," and "the Warrior." He was the husband of Empress Mathilde of B
2 CONC oulogne, and Empress Marie de France.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------- Wim Van Uytfange ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hij was de eerste volwaardige Hertog van Brabant.
