2 CONT Parsons, John Carmi (1995). Eleanor of Castile, Queen and Society in Thirteenth-Century England. Palgrave Macmillan.
2 CONT Prestwich, Michael (1988). Edward I. University of California Press.
2 CONT Richardson, Douglas (2011). Everingham, Kimball G. (ed.). Plantagenet Ancestry: A Study in Colonial and Medieval Families.
