2 CONT 10.      '''MARGARET''' (Windsor Castle 11 Sep [1275]-1318 or after 11 Mar 1333, bur Brussels, Saints Michael and Gudula).  The Continuator of Florence of Worcester records the birth in 1275 at Windsor of "filiam…Margaret" to "Ali
