2 CONC son of JEAN I Duke of Brabant & his second wife Marguerite de Flandre (27 Sep 1275-Château de Tervueren 27 Oct 1312, Brussels Saints Michael and Gudula).  He succeeded his father in 1294 as JEAN II Duke of Brabant.
