1 NOTE was born 1244 in Castile, Spain. She died 24 Nov 1290 in Herdeby, Near Grantham, Lincolnshire and was buried in Westminster Abbey, London, England. Eleanor married Edward I (LONGSHANKS) King of England on 18 Oct 1254 in Abbey of L
2 CONC as Huelgas, Burgos, Castile.
