2 CONT Berengaria de Castilla was born circa 1198/99. She was the daughter of Alfonso IX, Rey de Castilla y León and Berengaria de Castilla.1 She married Jean I de Brienne, Emperor of Constantinople, son of Erard II, Comte de Brienne and
2 CONC  Agnes de Montfaucon, in 1223.2 She died on 12 April 1237.2 Children of Berengaria de Castilla and Jean I de Brienne, Emperor of Constantinople
