2 CONT
2 CONT           o Richenza (c. 1157 - 1167)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * by his second wife, Matilda, daughter of King Henry II of England (married 1168):
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Matilda (1171-1210), married Godfrey, Count of Perche, and Enguerrand III, Lord of Coucy
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Richenza (1172-1204), was engaged to King Valdemar II of Denmark
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Henry V, Count Palatine of the Rhine (c. 1173-1227)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Lothar of Bavaria (c. 1174-1190)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Otto IV, Holy Roman Emperor and Duke of Swabia (c. 1175-1218)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o William of Winchester (1184-1213)
2 CONT
