2 CONT
2 CONT           o Richenza (died 1167)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * by his second wife, Matilda, daughter of King Henry II of England (married 1168):
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Matilda (c. 1172-c. 1209), married Godfrey, Count of Perche, and Enguerrand III, Count of Coucy
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Richza (1172-1204), married King Valdemar II of Denmark
2 CONT
