2 CONT 429873844. Kong Boleslav III. Crivusti (skjevmunn) VLADISLAVSØN av Polen (15319) was born in 1086. He was born on 20 Aug 1086. (15320) He was a Hertug between 1102 and 1138 in Polen. He was a Konge between 1102 and 1138 in Polen.(
2 CONC 15321) He died in 1138. He died on 28 Oct 1138. (15322) Han tvang innbyggerne av Pommern til å underkaste sig, og utbredte kristendommen blandt dem. han fandt sig i det tyske overherredømme og hyllet både Henrik V. og senere Lot
2 CONC har. He was married to Salome HENRIKSDTR av Berg-Schelklingen in 1113.
