2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphrosyne of Kiev, (c. 1130 – c. 1193), Queen Consort of Hungary.
2 CONT
2 CONT Euphrosyne was the first daughter of Grand Prince Mstislav I of Kiev and his second wife, Liubava Dmitrievna. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Christine died on January 18, 1122; later that year Mstislav married again, to Liubava Dmitrievna, the daughter of Dmitry Zavidich, a nobleman of Novgorod. Their children were:
2 CONT
