2 CONT      Stephen IV Arpád, King of Hungary was the son of Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary and Helen of Serbia. (1) He married Mary Comnene, daughter of Sebastokrator Isaac Comnenos, in 1156. (1) He died in 1165. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Stephen IV Arpád, King of Hungary gained the title of King Stephen IV of Hungary in 1163. (1)
