1 NOTE Andrew III of Hungary, son of Prince Stephen, grandson of Andrew II, succeeded Ladislaus IV as King of Hungary in 1290.  He ruled until 1301, and was the last of the Arpad Dynasty of Hungarian Kings.  He was succeeded by Wenceslau
2 CONC s of Bohemia.
