2 CONC es.[4] In 1955 Pope Pius XII abolished this octave.[5] The 1962 Roman Missal changed the rank of the feast from "Double" to "Third-Class Feast".[6] The 1969 reform of the Calendar classified the celebration as an optional "Memoria
