1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yolande de Dreux (1212-1248)
2 CONT
2 CONT Un article de Wikipédia, l'encyclopédie libre.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yolande_de_Dreux_(1212-1248)
2 CONT
2 CONT Yolande de Dreux, née en 1212, morte en 1248, est la fille de Robert III, comte de Dreux, et d'Aénor, dame de Saint-Valéry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elle épouse en 1229 Hugues IV (1213 † 1272), duc de Bourgogne, et eut :
2 CONT
2 CONT #Eudes, (1230 † 1269), comte de Nevers, d'Auxerre et de de Tonnerre
2 CONT
2 CONT #Jean, (1231 † 1267), seigneur de Bourbon et de Charolais
2 CONT
2 CONT #Alix (1233 † 1273) mariée en 1251 à Henri III, duc de Brabant († 1261)
2 CONT
2 CONT #Marguerite († 1277) mariée en 1239 à Guillaume III de Mont-St-Jean (+1256), puis en 1259 à Gui VI, vicomte de Limoges († 1263)
2 CONT
2 CONT #Robert II, (1248 † 1306), duc de Bourgogne
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Yolande of Dreux (1212-1248) was the first wife of Hugh IV of Burgundy (9 March 1213 – 27 October 1271) who was duke of Burgundy between 1218 and 1271. She was the daughter of Count Robert III "Gasteblé" of Dreux and of Braine, an
2 CONC d his wife Aénor of Saint-Valéry.
2 CONT
2 CONT Yolande's children with Hugh IV of Burgundy included:
2 CONT
2 CONT     *
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Margaret, Lady of Molinot (1229–1277), married William, count of Mont St Jean
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Eudes, count of Nevers and Auxerre (1230–1266)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o John (1231–1268), married Agnes and had Beatrice of Burgundy, heiress of Bourbon (through Agnes)
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Adelaide of Burgundy (1233–1273), married Henry III, Duke of Brabant
2 CONT
2 CONT           o Robert II, Duke of Burgundy (1248–1306)
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice of Vergy 	Duchess Consort of Burgundy
2 CONT
2 CONT 1218-1248 	Succeeded by
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrice of Navarre
2 CONT
