0 @N6000000003949913152@ NOTE Curt Hofemann, curt_hofemann AT yahoo.com, in a post-em, gives a little of Ioanna's ancestry.
1 CONT Per Lindsay Brook in _The Genealogist_ (APSG) 1981, Vol. 1, no. 2 article titled: "The Byzantine Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles, Prince of Wales" she was: NN Phokaina. Per ES II:182 she was Ioanna Phokaina (Karatzae,Phokain). Per 
1 CONC Brook she was dau of Constantine The Rupenid Lord of Vaghka & Partzerpert.
1 CONT Her mother was a Greek descended from Bardas Phokas, patrikios magistros, domestikos ton scholon c941-70 [Ref: Brook p25]
1 CONT Constantine was son of Rupen I Lord of Gobidar & Goromosol (b. ca 1020, d. ca 1095)& NN Dermokaitissa dau of Michael or Ioannes Dermokaites [Ref: Brook p12]
1 CONT Byzantine history/genealogy is not my strong suit & I haven't a clue where/what Vaghka, Partzerpert, Gobidar & Goromosol are & Ioannes Dermokaites is Greek to me - pun intended ;>)
