0 @N6000000002322312570@ NOTE Count of Luxembourg from 1288, he became the first German king from the House
1 CONT of Luxembourg in 1308. Henry strengthened the position of his family by
1 CONT obtaining the throne of Bohemia for his son, John of Luxembourg. He failed,
1 CONT however, in his attempt to bind Italy firmly to the empire, asuming the
1 CONT Lombard crown as King of the Lombards in January 1311. In August 1313, on an
1 CONT expedition against Naples, he was stricken with fever and died.
