0 @N6000000005599009152@ NOTE Frederick II of Hohenstaufen (1090 - 1147) was duke of Swabia, succeed ing his father, duke Frederick I in 1105. In 1121 he married Judith o f Bavaria, a member of the powerful House of Guelph.  On the death ofE mperor Henry V, hi
