1 CONT HENRY V, son of HENRY IV and BERTHA DE SAVOIE, was called the Lion because of his amazing personal bravery and strength, but he seemed to lack political sense.  He set himself up vs his cousin,
1 CONT  Frederick Barbarossa, the Holy Roman Emperor, and twice
1 CONT that great juggernaut rolled him right out of his dominions ... Matilda was his second wife ... and brought 5 sons and a daughter into the world[BIGOD-Mel Morris,10Gen Anc.FTW]
