1 CONT
1 CONT He was married to Gisela of Burgundy, daughter of William I, Count of Burgundy, and had 7 children:
1 CONT
1 CONT 1. Amadeus III of Savoy
1 CONT 2. William, Bishop of Liège
1 CONT 3. Adelaide, (d. 1154), married to Louis VI of France
1 CONT 4. Agnes, (d. 1127), married to Arcimboldo VI (Archibald VI in English), lord of Bourbon
1 CONT 5. Humbert
1 CONT 6. Reginald
1 CONT 7. Guy, abbey of Namur
