0 @N6000000000945053885@ NOTE Etienette (Stephania) var muligens datter til Raimund II av Barcelona.
0 @N6000000005598872001@ NOTE Wikipedia suggests that Etienette is of unknown origin.  At least ones ouce indicates that Etienette may have been the daughter of AdalbertII I Duke de Haute Lorraine (Upper Lorraine) and his alleged wife Clemenc ia de Carcassonne
1 CONC .  Other sources indicate that she may have been the daughter of Raymond Berengar I - Count of Barcelona, the Crooked; and one of his two wives.  No evidence of this has been located.  The pare nts of Etienette (Stephanie) de Long
1 CONC wy needs additional research.
