0 @N6000000007329706484@ NOTE [Alan Wilson, Nov 10'95 soc.gene.med.] Hugh II 'the Peaceful' is son   of
1 CONT Eudes I Borel ( - 23 May 1103), Duke of Burgundy and Sibyl of   Burgundy
1 CONT (ca  1065 - after 1103), dau, of William, Count of Burgundy and Macon,
1 CONT and  Stephanie of Longwy.  [See also Winkhaus, p. 52; Weis, 132-24.]
1 CONT [James A. Stephens, Nov 15 '95 soc.gene.med <jstevens -at-   iquest.net>]
1 CONT :  QUESTION :  The Royal database agrees with Weis that Hugh's wife was
1 CONT Stephanie, or Etienette of Longwy, but does not list parents for her.
1 CONT 'Colonial & Revolutionary Lineages in America', Vol 5, has Hugh's   wife
1 CONT was  ETIENETTE, dau of RAIMOND BERENGER II 'TOWHEAD', COUNT OF BARCELONA
1 CONT &  CARCASSONE (d. 1082) and MATILDA, dau of ROBERTO GISCARD. Could these
1 CONT two  Stephanies be one and the same, or is there disagrement between the
1 CONT sources on who Hugh's wife was ?
